4 8.64256-2.41664 0.49152-5.40672 0.73728-9.74848 0.73728-2.17088 0-4.42368 0-7.12704-0.12288h-0.45056c-2.4576-0.04096-5.36576-0.12288-8.27392-0.12288-8.31488 0-33.30048-9.74848-48.9472-41.04192a37.6832 37.6832 0 0 0-1.10592-2.048c-16.09728-27.68896-16.9984-76.8 6.3488-148.48a36.864 36.864 0 0 0-35.0208-48.29184H265.25696c-58.7776 0-88.76032-46.6944-77.57824-82.90304l77.0048-249.61024c8.35584-27.19744 38.37952-50.21696 77.53728-50.21696h298.1888c23.63392 0 42.8032 19.16928 42.8032 42.84416v349.92128c0 0.28672-0.04096 1.2288-1.2288 2.8672a18.59584 18.59584 0 0 1-6.5536 5.44768 189.6448 189.6448 0 0 0-91.42272 101.9904c-10.24 27.11552-14.41792 51.73248-17.57184 70.20544l-1.2288 7.04512c-3.6864 20.8896-6.43072 28.34432-10.4448 33.1776zM806.912 602.112a36.864 36.864 0 0 0 73.728 0v-409.6a36.864 36.864 0 1 0-73.728 0v409.6z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg> <!----></div><!----> <!----> <!----></div></div>   <!----> <!----> <!----> <!----></div></div></div></div><div data-v-38e35b58="" class="chat-content-item chat-content-item-user" data-archer-id="19f24912-0392-83f2-8000-0a16e5c73de7"><!----> <div data-v-a660adc4="" data-v-38e35b58="" class="segment segment-user"><!----> <div data-v-a660adc4="" class="segment-container" dir="auto"> <!----> <!----> <div data-v-a660adc4="" class="segment-content"><div data-v-a660adc4="" class="segment-content-box"> <div data-v-d3915d44="" data-v-d664c8c3="" class="user-content"><!----> Great! You have the SystemRescue ISO. Let's flash it to USB and boot from it.

---

## Step 1: Flash SystemRescue to USB

1. **Open balenaEtcher**
2. Click **"Flash from file"**
3. Select your **SystemRescue ISO**
4. Click **"Select target"** → Choose your **USB drive**
5. Click **"Flash!"**
6. Wait for it to complete (says "Flash Complete")

---

## Step 2: Boot from USB

1. **Restart your PC**
2. **Spam F12** during startup
3. Select **UEFI: VendorCoProductCode** (or USB option)
4. SystemRescue should boot without kernel panic

---

## Step 3: SystemRescue Loads

You'll see a menu. Select:
- **"Boot SystemRescue using default options"** or
- **"Boot SystemRescue (64-bit)"**

Wait for it to load.

---

## Step 4: Fix GRUB

Once at the desktop (or command prompt), open terminal and run:

```bash
# Find your Parrot partition
fdisk -l

# Mount BTRFS partition with subvolume
mount -o subvol=@ /dev/sda4 /mnt/parrot

# Check if data is there
ls /mnt/parrot/home/

# Mount EFI partition
mount /dev/sda1 /mnt/parrot/boot/efi

# Reinstall GRUB
grub-install --boot-directory=/mnt/parrot/boot /dev/sda

# Update GRUB config
chroot /mnt/parrot
update-grub
exit

# Reboot
reboot
```

---

**Flash the USB now and let me know when SystemRescue boots!**</div> <!----> <!----> <!----> <!----></div>  <!----> <!----> <!----> <!---->   <!----> <div data-v-38e35b58="" class="okc-cards-container"><!----> <!----> <!----> <!----> <!----></div> <!----> <!----> <!----> <div data-v-b1bd13bb="" data-v-a660adc4="" class="segment-user-action-row"><div data-v-b1bd13bb="" class="segment-user-actions"> <div data-v-351fdc4e="" data-v-b1bd13bb="" class="simple-button size-small"><svg data-v-351fdc4e="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" role="img" class="iconify simple-button-icon" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" name="Edit"><path d="M736.085333 222.592a46.165333 46.165333 0 0 1 65.322667 65.28L336.426667 752.938667a132.266667 132.266667 0 0 1-61.44 34.773333l-51.541334 12.885333 12.885334-51.541333a132.266667 132.266667 0 0 1 34.773333-61.44L736.085333 222.592z m32.682667-90.325333c-32.64 0-63.914667 12.970667-86.997333 36.010666L216.832 633.258667a209.066667 209.066667 0 0 0-55.04 97.152l-28.373333 113.621333a38.4 38.4 0 0 0 46.549333 46.549333l113.621333-28.416a209.066667 209.066667 0 0 0 97.152-54.997333l361.813334-361.813333 103.168-103.125334A122.965333 122.965333 0 0 0 768.768 132.266667zM512 814.933333a38.4 38.4 0 1 0 0 76.8h298.666667a38.4 38.4 0 1 0 0-76.8h-298.666667z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg> <span data-v-351fdc4e="">Edit</span></div> <div data-v-351fdc4e="" data-v-92afdd37="" data-v-b1bd13bb="" class="simple-button size-small"><svg data-v-351fdc4e="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" role="img" class="iconify simple-button-icon" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" name="Copy"><path d="M725.333333 302.933333a166.4 166.4 0 0 1 166.4 166.4v256a166.4 166.4 0 0 1-166.4 166.4h-256A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 302.933333 725.333333v-256A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 469.333333 302.933333h256z m-256 76.8A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 379.733333 469.333333v256c0 49.493333 40.106667 89.