div></div></div><div data-v-38e35b58="" class="chat-content-item chat-content-item-user" data-archer-id="19f24a38-0772-85e4-8000-0a168e2b260b"><!----> <div data-v-a660adc4="" data-v-38e35b58="" class="segment segment-user"><!----> <div data-v-a660adc4="" class="segment-container" dir="auto"> <!----> <div data-v-65d6f9fd="" data-v-a660adc4="" class="attachment-list"><div data-v-65d6f9fd="" class="attachment-list-image single"><div data-v-c774e65a="" data-v-65d6f9fd="" class="image-thumbnail large loading"><div data-v-c774e65a="" class="image-mask"><div data-v-c774e65a="" class="loading-icon"></div></div> <span data-v-0fac845b="" data-v-c774e65a="" class="image-wrapper image-detail"><!----> <img data-v-0fac845b="" class="image-main is-cover" loading="lazy" alt=""> <!----></span> <!----></div></div> <!----></div> <div data-v-a660adc4="" class="segment-content"><div data-v-a660adc4="" class="segment-content-box"> <div data-v-d3915d44="" data-v-d664c8c3="" class="user-content"><!----> Now you should figure it out?</div> <!----> <!----> <!----> <!----></div>  <!----> <!----> <!----> <!---->   <!----> <div data-v-38e35b58="" class="okc-cards-container"><!----> <!----> <!----> <!----> <!----></div> <!----> <!----> <!----> <div data-v-b1bd13bb="" data-v-a660adc4="" class="segment-user-action-row"><div data-v-b1bd13bb="" class="segment-user-actions"> <div data-v-351fdc4e="" data-v-b1bd13bb="" class="simple-button size-small"><svg data-v-351fdc4e="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" role="img" class="iconify simple-button-icon" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" name="Edit"><path d="M736.085333 222.592a46.165333 46.165333 0 0 1 65.322667 65.28L336.426667 752.938667a132.266667 132.266667 0 0 1-61.44 34.773333l-51.541334 12.885333 12.885334-51.541333a132.266667 132.266667 0 0 1 34.773333-61.44L736.085333 222.592z m32.682667-90.325333c-32.64 0-63.914667 12.970667-86.997333 36.010666L216.832 633.258667a209.066667 209.066667 0