9.557333 163.925333-105.386667 270.933334-107.861334a42.026667 42.026667 0 0 1 42.752 42.24v125.226667c0 34.56 38.272 53.845333 65.706666 35.925333l5.376-4.096 304.426667-272.213333a42.666667 42.666667 0 0 0 2.986667-60.714667l-3.413334-3.285333-304.469333-264.277333z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg> <span data-v-351fdc4e="">Share</span></div> <!----></div> <!----></div>   <!----> <!----> <!----> <!----></div></div></div></div><div data-v-38e35b58="" class="chat-content-item chat-content-item-assistant" data-archer-id="19f5c68e-8612-839c-8000-0a1697cf618e"><!----> <div data-v-a660adc4="" data-v-38e35b58="" class="segment segment-assistant"><div data-v-88be9e2e="" data-v-a660adc4="" class="segment-avatar"><div data-v-88be9e2e="" class="avatar"><canvas data-v-b81624a4="" data-v-88be9e2e="" style="width: 56px; height: 56px;" class="rive-container" width="112" height="112"></canvas></div></div> <div data-v-a660adc4="" class="segment-container" dir="auto"> <!----> <!----> <div data-v-a660adc4="" class="segment-content"><div data-v-a660adc4="" class="segment-content-box"> <!----> <div data-v-3b9ae98b="" data-v-d664c8c3="" class="markdown-container"><div data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="markdown"><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">You want to <strong>increase your Parrot partition size</strong>. This requires shrinking another partition (likely Windows) and expanding Parrot into the freed space.</div><hr><h2>⚠️ WARNING: BACKUP YOUR DATA FIRST!</h2><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Partition resizing can cause data loss. Make sure you have backups of important files from both Windows and Parrot before proceeding.</div><hr><h2>Method: Use GParted from SystemRescue USB</h2><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Since you can't resize a mounted partition, you'll need to boot from your <strong>SystemRescue USB</strong> again and use <strong>GParted</strong>.</div><hr><h2>Steps</h2><h3>Step 1: Boot SystemRescue USB</h3><ol start="1"><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Insert your SystemRescue USB</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Restart your PC and spam <strong>F12</strong> to enter boot menu</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Select the USB drive</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">At the SystemRescue menu, type <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">startx</code> to load the GUI (or select graphical option)</div></li></ol><h3>Step 2: Open GParted</h3><ol start="1"><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">In the GUI, open <strong>GParted</strong> (Partition Manager)</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Select your disk (likely <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">/dev/sda</code>)</div></li></ol><h3>Step 3: Shrink Windows Partition</h3><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Your current layout from <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">fdisk -l</code>:</div><ul start="1"><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto"><code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">sda1</code> — 100MB EFI</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto"><code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">sda2</code> — 16MB Microsoft reserved</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto"><code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">sda3</code> — 160.4GB Windows (NTFS)</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto"><code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">sda4</code> — 52.2GB Parrot (BTRFS)</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto"><code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">sda5</code> — 7.8GB Windows (NTFS)</div></li></ul><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">You need to <strong>shrink <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">sda3</code></strong> (the big Windows partition) to free up space.</div><ol start="1"><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Right-click on <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">sda3</code> → <strong>Resize/Move</strong></div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Drag the right edge left to shrink it (leave at least 50-80GB for Windows)</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Click <strong>Resize/Move</strong></div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Apply the operation (green checkmark)</div></li></ol><blockquote><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">⚠️ <strong>NTFS resize may require disabling Fast Startup in Windows first!</strong></div></blockquote><h3>Step 4: Expand Parrot Partition</h3><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">After shrinking Windows, you'll have <strong>unallocated space</strong>.</div><ol start="1"><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Right-click on <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">sda4</code> (Parrot BTRFS) → <strong>Resize/Move</strong></div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Drag the right edge to fill the unallocated space</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Click <strong>Resize/Move</strong></div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Apply</div></li></ol><h3>Step 5: Reboot</h3><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Remove USB and boot normally.</div><hr><h2>⚠️ Important: Disable Windows Fast Startup First!</h2><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Before resizing, boot into <strong>Windows</strong> and disable Fast Startup:</div><ol start="1"><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Open <strong>Control Panel</strong> → <strong>Power Options</strong></div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Click <strong>Choose what the power buttons do</strong></div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Click <strong>Change settings that are currently unavailable</strong></div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto"><strong>Uncheck</strong> "Turn on fast startup"</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Save changes</div></li></ol><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">This prevents Windows from locking the NTFS partition.</div><hr><h2>Alternative: Use Windows Disk Management</h2><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">You can also shrink the Windows partition from within Windows:</div><ol start="1"><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Boot into <strong>Windows</strong></div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Press <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">Win + X</code> → <strong>Disk Management</strong></div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Right-click <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">C:</code> drive → <strong>Shrink Volume</strong></div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Enter amount to shrink (in MB)</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">This creates unallocated space</div></li></ol><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Then boot SystemRescue and expand <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">sda4</code> into that space with GParted.</div><hr><h2>Which Method Do You Want?</h2><div data-v-01af594f="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="table markdown-table"><div data-v-13fde6a9="" data-v-01af594f="" class="sticky-release" style="--sticky-header-height: 42.5px;"><div data-v-13fde6a9="" class="sticky-release-rail"><div data-v-13fde6a9="" class="sticky-release-header" style="top: 0px;"><header data-v-01af594f="" class="table-actions"><div data-v-01af594f="" class="table-actions-content"><span data-v-01af594f="" class="table-title">Table</span> <span data-v-868ea423="" data-v-01af594f=""><div data-v-1005b780="" data-v-868ea423="" class="icon-button" style="width: 32px; height: 32px;"><svg data-v-1005b780="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" role="img" class="iconify" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" name="Copy"><path d="M725.333333 302.933333a166.4 166.4 0 0 1 166.4 166.4v256a166.4 166.4 0 0 1-166.4 166.4h-256A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 302.933333 725.333333v-256A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 469.333333 302.933333h256z m-256 76.8A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 379.733333 469.333333v256c0 49.493333 40.106667 89.6 89.6 89.6h256a89.6 89.6 0 0 0 89.6-89.6v-256A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 725.333333 379.733333h-256z" fill="currentColor"></path><path d="M554.666667 132.266667a166.4 166.4 0 0 1 144.128 83.2 38.4 38.4 0 0 1-66.517334 38.4A89.514667 89.514667 0 0 0 554.666667 209.066667H298.666667A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 209.066667 298.666667v256c0 33.109333 17.92 62.08 44.8 77.653333a38.4 38.4 0 0 1-38.4 66.474667A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 132.266667 554.666667V298.666667A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 298.666667 132.266667h256z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg> <div data-v-5f9e9bf6="" data-v-1005b780="" class="kimi-tooltip tooltip-bottom icon-button-tooltip bottom">Copy</div></div></span> <div data-v-1005b780="" data-v-01af594f="" class="icon-button table-actions-icon" style="width: 32px; height: 32px;"><svg data-v-1005b780="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" role="img" class="iconify" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" name="Download"><path d="M512 126.976a36.864 36.864 0 0 1 36.864 36.864v347.91424l119.11168-119.11168a36.864 36.864 0 1 1 52.14208 52.14208l-182.0672 182.02624a36.864 36.864 0 0 1-52.10112 0l-182.0672-182.02624a36.864 36.864 0 0 1 52.14208-52.14208l119.11168 119.11168V163.84a36.864 36.864 0 0 1 36.864-36.864zM184.32 564.71552a36.864 36.864 0 0 1 36.864 36.864v145.65376a35.96288 35.96288 0 0 0 35.96288 35.96288h509.70624a35.96288 35.96288 0 0 0 35.96288-35.96288v-145.65376a36.864 36.864 0 0 1 73.728 0v145.65376a109.69088 109.69088 0 0 1-109.69088 109.69088H257.14688A109.69088 109.69088 0 0 1 147.456 747.23328v-145.65376a36.864 36.864 0 0 1 36.864-36.864z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg> <!----></div><!----></div></header></div></div></div> <div data-v-01af594f="" class="table-container"><table data-v-01af594f=""><thead data-v-01af594f=""><tr data-v-01af594f=""><th data-v-01af594f="" align="left">Method</th><th data-v-01af594f="" align="left">Pros</th><th data-v-01af594f="" align="left">Cons</th></tr></thead> <tbody data-v-01af594f=""><tr data-v-01af594f=""><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left"><strong data-v-01af594f="">GParted from SystemRescue</strong></td><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left">Can do everything in one go</td><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left">Need USB boot</td></tr><tr data-v-01af594f=""><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left"><strong data-v-01af594f="">Shrink in Windows first</strong></td><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left">Safer for NTFS</td><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left">Two-step process</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class="paragraph" dir="auto"><strong>My recommendation:</strong> Boot into Windows first, disable Fast Startup, then shrink C: drive in Disk Management. Then boot SystemRescue and expand Parrot with GParted.</div><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Want me to walk you through either method in detail? 🚀</div></div></div> <!----> <!----> <!----></div>  <!----> <!----> <!----> <!---->   <!----> <div data-v-38e35b58="" class="okc-cards-container"><!----> <!----> <!----> <!----> <!----></div> <!----> <!----> <!----> <div data-v-b1bd13bb="" data-v-a660adc4="" class="segment-assistant-actions"><div data-v-b1bd13bb="" class="segment-assistant-actions-content"> <!----> <!----> <!----><div data-v-1005b780="" data-v-b1bd13bb="" class="icon-button" style="width: 28px; height: 28px;"><svg data-v-1005b780="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" role="img" class="iconify" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" name="Copy"><path d="M725.333333 302.933333a166.4 166.4 0 0 1 166.4 166.4v256a166.4 166.4 0 0 1-166.4 166.4h-256A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 302.933333 725.333333v-256A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 469.333333 302.933333h256z m-256 76.8A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 379.733333 469.333333v256c0 49.493333 40.106667 89.6 89.6 89.6h256a89.6 89.6 0 0 0 89.6-89.6v-256A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 725.333333 379.733333h-256z" fill="currentColor"></path><path d="M554.666667 132.266667a166.4 166.4 0 0 1 144.128 83.2 38.4 38.4 0 0 1-66.517334 38.4A89.514667 89.514667 0 0 0 554.666667 209.066667H298.666667A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 209.066667 298.666667v256c0 33.109333 17.92 62.08 44.8 77.653333a38.4 38.4 0 0 1-38.4 66.474667A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 132.266667 554.666667V298.666667A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 298.666667 132.266667h256z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg> <!----></div><!----> <!----><div data-v-1005b780="" data-v-b1bd13bb="" class="icon-button" style="width: 28px; height: 28px;"><svg data-v-1005b780="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" role="img" class="iconify" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" name="Refresh"><path d="M303.104 315.392c114.688-114.688 303.104-114.688 417.792 0l-32.768 32.768c-20.48 20.48-4.096 57.344 24.576 57.344h118.784c16.384 0 32.768-16.384 32.768-32.768V253.952c0-28.672-36.864-45.056-57.344-24.576l-32.768 32.768c-143.36-143.36-376.832-143.36-520.192 0s-143.36 376.832 0 520.192 376.832 143.36 520.192 0c49.152-49.152 77.824-106.496 94.208-163.84 4.096-20.48-8.192-40.96-24.576-45.056-20.48-4.096-40.96 8.192-45.056 24.576-12.288 49.152-36.864 94.208-77.824 131.072-114.688 114.688-303.104 114.688-417.792 0-114.688-110.592-114.688-299.008 0-413.696z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg> <!----></div><!----> <!----><div data-v-1005b780="" data-v-b1bd13bb="" class="icon-button" style="width: 28px; height: 28px;"><svg data-v-1005b780="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" role="img" class="iconify" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" name="Share_a"><path d="M386.218667 247.850667c0-102.4 120.405333-157.397333 197.76-90.282667l304.426666 264.32a119.466667 119.466667 0 0 1 1.365334 179.285333l-304.469334 272.170667c-76.970667 68.778667-199.082667 14.122667-199.082666-89.088v-89.173333c-33.024 2.261333-59.306667 6.826667-83.2 15.36-30.592 10.88-61.866667 29.952-98.602667 67.712a76.8 76.8 0 0 1-131.84-53.504c0-98.645333 24.106667-190.976 83.712-261.888 55.253333-65.792 133.973333-104.789333 229.930667-117.845334V247.850667z m147.413333-32.256c-27.648-23.978667-70.613333-4.352-70.613333 32.256v126.208l-0.256 4.309333c-2.218667 21.504-20.437333 38.186667-42.410667 40.021333l-17.194667 1.706667c-173.994667 20.949333-253.824 136.405333-253.824 304.554667 86.997333-89.557333 163.925333-105.386667 270.933334-107.861334a42.026667 42.026667 0 0 1 42.752 42.24v125.226667c0 34.56 38.272 53.845333 65.706666 35.925333l5.376-4.096 304.426667-272.213333a42.666667 42.666667 0 0 0 2.986667-60.714667l-3.413334-3.285333-304.469333-264.277333z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg> <!----></div><!----> <!----><div data-v-1005b780="" data-v-b1bd13bb="" class="icon-button" style="width: 28px; height: 28px;"><svg data-v-1005b780="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" role="img" class="iconify" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" name="Like"><path d="M507.94496 118.70208L512 118.784c41.7792 0 88.92416 30.76096 114.36032 80.81408 25.23136 44.2368 25.64096 100.352 12.6976 159.04768h123.78112c95.4368 0 177.43872 82.98496 148.02944 178.33984l-76.96384 249.6512c-19.37408 62.79168-81.75616 102.1952-148.02944 102.1952h-298.1888a116.57216 116.57216 0 0 1-116.5312-116.57216V422.2976c0-35.2256 23.38816-61.27616 47.75936-73.85088a115.9168 115.9168 0 0 0 56.19712-62.464c7.5776-20.0704 10.60864-37.76512 13.80352-56.40192l1.35168-7.61856c3.44064-19.6608 8.35584-45.99808 26.624-67.74784 16.71168-19.94752 35.84-29.73696 55.17312-33.5872 13.27104-2.62144 27.97568-2.21184 35.88096-1.96608z m-21.54496 74.30144c-3.44064 0.69632-7.49568 2.048-13.06624 8.64256-4.01408 4.79232-6.79936 12.288-10.48576 33.1776l-1.2288 6.9632c-3.11296 18.51392-7.33184 43.13088-17.53088 70.20544a189.6448 189.6448 0 0 1-91.38176 102.03136 18.6368 18.6368 0 0 0-6.63552 5.44768c-1.14688 1.6384-1.2288 2.58048-1.2288 2.8672v349.92128c0 23.67488 19.2512 42.84416 42.88512 42.84416h298.14784c39.15776 0 69.2224-23.01952 77.57824-50.21696l76.96384-249.61024c11.18208-36.20864-18.80064-82.90304-77.57824-82.90304h-172.07296a36.864 36.864 0 0 1-35.06176-48.29184c23.3472-71.68 22.44608-120.832 6.3488-148.48a38.0928 38.0928 0 0 1-1.10592-2.048C545.30048 202.30144 520.31488 192.512 512 192.512c-2.90816 0-5.81632-0.08192-8.27392-0.12288h-0.45056a264.6016 264.6016 0 0 0-7.12704-0.12288c-4.34176 0-7.3728 0.24576-9.74848 0.73728zM184.32 385.024a36.864 36.864 0 0 1 36.864 36.864v409.6a36.864 36.864 0 1 1-73.728 0v-409.6a36.864 36.864 0 0 1 36.864-36.864z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg> <!----></div><!----> <!----><div data-v-1005b780="" data-v-b1bd13bb="" class="icon-button" style="width: 28px; height: 28px;"><svg data-v-1005b780="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" role="img" class="iconify" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" name="Dislike"><path d="M516.096 905.216l4.05504 0.08192c7.90528 0.24576 22.60992 0.65536 35.88096-1.96608 19.33312-3.85024 38.5024-13.63968 55.21408-33.5872 18.2272-21.74976 23.1424-48.08704 26.624-67.74784l1.31072-7.61856c3.19488-18.6368 6.22592-36.29056 13.80352-56.40192a115.9168 115.9168 0 0 1 56.19712-62.464c24.3712-12.57472 47.75936-38.58432 47.75936-73.85088V251.74016A116.57216 116.57216 0 0 0 640.36864 135.168h-298.1888c-66.23232 0-128.6144 39.40352-147.98848 102.1952l-77.0048 249.6512c-29.36832 95.35488 52.67456 178.33984 148.0704 178.33984h123.74016c-12.9024 58.65472-12.4928 114.85184 12.6976 159.08864 25.47712 49.9712 72.66304 80.77312 114.40128 80.77312z m38.66624-82.86208c-5.57056 6.59456-9.6256 7.94624-13.06624 8.64256-2.41664 0.49152-5.40672 0.73728-9.74848 0.73728-2.17088 0-4.42368 0-7.12704-0.12288h-0.45056c-2.4576-0.04096-5.36576-0.12288-8.27392-0.12288-8.31488 0-33.30048-9.74848-48.9472-41.04192a37.6832 37.6832 0 0 0-1.10592-2.048c-16.09728-27.68896-16.9984-76.8 6.3488-148.48a36.864 36.864 0 0 0-35.0208-48.29184H265.25696c-58.7776 0-88.76032-46.6944-77.57824-82.90304l77.0048-249.61024c8.35584-27.19744 38.37952-50.21696 77.53728-50.21696h298.1888c23.63392 0 42.8032 19.16928 42.8032 42.84416v349.92128c0 0.28672-0.04096 1.2288-1.2288 2.8672a18.59584 18.59584 0 0 1-6.5536 5.44768 189.6448 189.6448 0 0 0-91.42272 101.9904c-10.24 27.11552-14.41792 51.73248-17.57184 70.20544l-1.2288 7.04512c-3.6864 20.8896-6.43072 28.34432-10.4448 33.1776zM806.912 602.112a36.864 36.864 0 0 0 73.728 0v-409.6a36.864 36.864 0 1 0-73.728 0v409.6z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg> <!----></div><!----> <!----> <!----></div></div>   <!----> <!----> <!----> <!----></div></div></div></div><div data-v-38e35b58="" class="chat-content-item chat-content-item-user" data-archer-id="19f5c6b5-30a2-8fae-8000-0a163c188fd4"><!----> <div data-v-a660adc4="" data-v-38e35b58="" class="segment segment-user"><!----> <div data-v-a660adc4="" class="segment-container" dir="auto"> <!----> <!----> <div data-v-a660adc4="" class="segment-content"><div data-v-a660adc4="" class="segment-content-box"> <div data-v-d3915d44="" data-v-d664c8c3="" class="user-content"><!----> The thing is I dont have enough space! But I want to reset my windows and then add more space to parrot butmy worried is that is it possible to do so and not loose my parrot setup</div> <!----> <!----> <!----> <!----></div>  <!----> <!----> <!----> <!---->   <!----> <div data-v-38e35b58="" class="okc-cards-container"><!----> <!----> <!----> <!----> <!----></div> <!----> <!----> <!----> <div data-v-b1bd13bb="" data-v-a660adc4="" class="segment-user-action-row"><div data-v-b1bd13bb="" class="segment-user-actions"> <div data-v-351fdc4e="" data-v-b1bd13bb="" class="simple-button size-small"><svg data-v-351fdc4e="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" role="img" class="iconify simple-button-icon" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" name="Edit"><path d="M736.085333 222.592a46.165333 46.165333 0 0 1 65.322667 65.28L336.426667 752.938667a132.266667 132.266667 0 0 1-61.44 34.773333l-51.541334 12.885333 12.885334-5