 0 0 379.733333 469.333333v256c0 49.493333 40.106667 89.6 89.6 89.6h256a89.6 89.6 0 0 0 89.6-89.6v-256A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 725.333333 379.733333h-256z" fill="currentColor"></path><path d="M554.666667 132.266667a166.4 166.4 0 0 1 144.128 83.2 38.4 38.4 0 0 1-66.517334 38.4A89.514667 89.514667 0 0 0 554.666667 209.066667H298.666667A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 209.066667 298.666667v256c0 33.109333 17.92 62.08 44.8 77.653333a38.4 38.4 0 0 1-38.4 66.474667A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 132.266667 554.666667V298.666667A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 298.666667 132.266667h256z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg> <div data-v-5f9e9bf6="" data-v-1005b780="" class="kimi-tooltip tooltip-bottom icon-button-tooltip bottom">Copy</div></div></span></div></header></div></div></div> <div data-v-efb858b9="" data-v-8d822fd1="" class="syntax-highlighter dark segment-code-content"><pre data-v-efb858b9="" class="language-plain"><code class="language-plain">You want to **keep your Windows files** and still expand Parrot. That's totally doable — we just skip the "Reset Windows" step and **shrink the existing Windows partition** instead.</code></pre></div></div> <div data-v-d664c8c3=""></div><hr><h2>The Plan (Keep Windows Files)</h2><ol start="1"><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto"><strong>Disable Fast Startup in Windows</strong> (required for safe NTFS resize)</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto"><strong>Shrink Windows partition</strong> from Windows Disk Management</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto"><strong>Expand Parrot</strong> with SystemRescue + GParted</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto"><strong>Fix GRUB if needed</strong></div></li></ol><hr><h2>Step 1: Disable Fast Startup (CRITICAL!)</h2><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Boot into <strong>Windows</strong> now:</div><ol start="1"><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Open <strong>Control Panel</strong> → <strong>Power Options</strong></div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Click <strong>"Choose what the power buttons do"</strong></div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Click <strong>"Change settings that are currently unavailable"</strong></div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto"><strong>UNCHECK</strong> "Turn on fast startup (recommended)"</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Click <strong>Save changes</strong></div></li></ol><blockquote><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">⚠️ If you skip this, Windows might corrupt when shrinking!</div></blockquote><hr><h2>Step 2: Shrink Windows Partition</h2><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Still in Windows:</div><ol start="1"><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Press <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">Win + X</code> → <strong>Disk Management</strong></div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Right-click <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">C:</code> drive → <strong>Shrink Volume</strong></div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Windows will calculate available space</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Enter amount to shrink in MB:</div></li></ol><div data-v-01af594f="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="table markdown-table"><div data-v-13fde6a9="" data-v-01af594f="" class="sticky-release" style="--sticky-header-height: 42.5px;"><div data-v-13fde6a9="" class="sticky-release-rail"><div data-v-13fde6a9="" class="sticky-release-header" style="top: 0px;"><header data-v-01af594f="" class="table-actions"><div data-v-01af594f="" class="table-actions-content"><span data-v-01af594f="" class="table-title">Table</span> <span data-v-868ea423="" data-v-01af594f=""><div data-v-1005b780="" data-v-868ea423="" class="icon-button" style="width: 32px; height: 32px;"><svg data-v-1005b780="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" role="img" class="iconify" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" name="Copy"><path d="M725.333333 302.933333a166.4 166.4 0 0 1 166.4 166.4v256a166.4 166.4 0 0 1-166.4 166.4h-256A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 302.933333 725.333333v-256A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 469.333333 302.933333h256z m-256 76.8A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 379.733333 469.333333v256c0 49.493333 40.106667 89.6 89.6 89.6h256a89.6 89.6 0 0 0 89.6-89.6v-256A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 725.333333 379.733333h-256z" fill="currentColor"></path><path d="M554.666667 132.266667a166.4 166.4 0 0 1 144.128 83.2 38.4 38.4 0 0 1-66.517334 38.4A89.514667 89.514667 0 0 0 554.666667 209.066667H298.666667A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 209.066667 298.666667v256c0 33.109333 17.92 62.08 44.8 77.653333a38.4 38.4 0 0 1-38.4 66.474667A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 132.266667 554.666667V298.666667A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 298.666667 132.266667h256z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg> <div data-v-5f9e9bf6="" data-v-1005b780="" class="kimi-tooltip tooltip-bottom icon-button-tooltip bottom">Copy</div></div></span> <div data-v-1005b780="" data-v-01af594f="" class="icon-button table-actions-icon" style="width: 32px; height: 32px;"><svg data-v-1005b780="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" role="img" class="iconify" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" name="Download"><path d="M512 126.976a36.864 36.864 0 0 1 36.864 36.864v347.91424l119.11168-119.11168a36.864 36.864 0 1 1 52.14208 52.14208l-182.0672 182.02624a36.864 36.864 0 0 1-52.10112 0l-182.0672-182.02624a36.864 36.864 0 0 1 52.14208-52.14208l119.11168 119.11168V163.84a36.864 36.864 0 0 1 36.864-36.864zM184.32 564.71552a36.864 36.864 0 0 1 36.864 36.864v145.65376a35.96288 35.96288 0 0 0 35.96288 35.96288h509.70624a35.96288 35.96288 0 0 0 35.96288-35.96288v-145.65376a36.864 36.864 0 0 1 73.728 0v145.65376a109.69088 109.69088 0 0 1-109.69088 109.69088H257.14688A109.69088 109.69088 0 0 1 147.456 747.23328v-145.65376a36.864 36.864 0 0 1 36.864-36.864z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg> <!----></div><!----></div></header></div></div></div> <div data-v-01af594f="" class="table-container"><table data-v-01af594f=""><thead data-v-01af594f=""><tr data-v-01af594f=""><th data-v-01af594f="" align="left">Want for Parrot</th><th data-v-01af594f="" align="left">Enter this</th></tr></thead> <tbody data-v-01af594f=""><tr data-v-01af594f=""><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left">+60GB</td><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left"><code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">61440</code></td></tr><tr data-v-01af594f=""><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left">+80GB</td><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left"><code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">81920</code></td></tr><tr data-v-01af594f=""><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left">+100GB</td><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left"><code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">102400</code></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><ol start="5"><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Click <strong>Shrink</strong></div></li></ol><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">You'll see <strong>Unallocated space</strong> appear.</div><hr><h2>Step 3: Expand Parrot with SystemRescue</h2><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Boot from your <strong>SystemRescue USB</strong>:</div><ol start="1"><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Restart, spam <strong>F12</strong>, select USB</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Type <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">startx</code> for GUI</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Open <strong>GParted</strong></div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Select <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">/dev/sda</code></div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Right-click <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">sda4</code> (52.2GB) → <strong>Resize/Move</strong></div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Drag right edge to fill unallocated space</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Click <strong>Resize/Move</strong> → Apply (green checkmark)</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Reboot, remove USB</div></li></ol><hr><h2>Step 4: Verify GRUB</h2><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">If Windows boots directly (no GRUB menu), boot SystemRescue and reinstall GRUB:</div><div data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code"><div data-v-13fde6a9="" data-v-8d822fd1="" class="sticky-release" style="--sticky-header-height: 42.5px;"><div data-v-13fde6a9="" class="sticky-release-rail"><div data-v-13fde6a9="" class="sticky-release-header" style="top: 0px;"><header data-v-8d822fd1="" class="segment-code-header"><div data-v-8d822fd1="" class="segment-code-header-content"><span data-v-8d822fd1="" class="segment-code-lang">bash</span> <!----> <span data-v-868ea423="" data-v-8d822fd1=""><div data-v-1005b780="" data-v-868ea423="" class="icon-button" style="width: 32px; height: 32px;"><svg data-v-1005b780="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" role="img" class="iconify" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" name="Copy"><path d="M725.333333 302.933333a166.4 166.4 0 0 1 166.4 166.4v256a166.4 166.4 0 0 1-166.4 166.4h-256A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 302.933333 725.333333v-256A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 469.333333 302.933333h256z m-256 76.8A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 379.733333 469.333333v256c0 49.493333 40.106667 89.6 89.6 89.6h256a89.6 89.6 0 0 0 89.6-89.6v-256A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 725.333333 379.733333h-256z" fill="currentColor"></path><path d="M554.666667 132.266667a166.4 166.4 0 0 1 144.128 83.2 38.4 38.4 0 0 1-66.517334 38.4A89.514667 89.514667 0 0 0 554.666667 209.066667H298.666667A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 209.066667 298.666667v256c0 33.109333 17.92 62.08 44.8 77.653333a38.4 38.4 0 0 1-38.4 66.474667A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 132.266667 554.666667V298.666667A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 298.666667 132.266667h256z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg> <div data-v-5f9e9bf6="" data-v-1005b780="" class="kimi-tooltip tooltip-bottom icon-button-tooltip bottom">Copy</div></div></span></div></header></div></div></div> <div data-v-efb858b9="" data-v-8d822fd1="" class="syntax-highlighter dark segment-code-content"><pre data-v-efb858b9="" class="language-bash"><code class="language-bash"><span class="token function">mount</span> <span class="token parameter variable">-o</span> <span class="token assign-left variable">subvol</span><span class="token operator">=</span>@ /dev/sda4 /mnt/parrot
<span class="token function">mount</span> <span class="token parameter variable">-t</span> devtmpfs devtmpfs /mnt/parrot/dev
<span class="token function">mount</span> <span class="token parameter variable">-t</span> proc proc /mnt/parrot/proc
<span class="token function">mount</span> <span class="token parameter variable">-t</span> sysfs sysfs /mnt/parrot/sys
<span class="token function">mount</span> <span class="token parameter variable">-t</span> tmpfs tmpfs /mnt/parrot/run
<span class="token function">chroot</span> /mnt/parrot
<span class="token function">mkdir</span> <span class="token parameter variable">-p</span> /boot/efi
<span class="token function">mount</span> /dev/sda1 /boot/efi
grub-install /dev/sda
<span class="token function">update-grub</span>
<span class="token builtin class-name">exit</span>
<span class="token function">reboot</span></code></pre></div></div> <div data-v-d664c8c3=""></div><hr><h2>How Much to Shrink?</h2><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Your Windows is <strong>168.4GB</strong>. How much do you want to keep?</div><div data-v-01af594f="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="table markdown-table"><div data-v-13fde6a9="" data-v-01af594f="" class="sticky-release" style="--sticky-header-height: 42.5px;"><div data-v-13fde6a9="" class="sticky-release-rail"><div data-v-13fde6a9="" class="sticky-release-header" style="top: 0px;"><header data-v-01af594f="" class="table-actions"><div data-v-01af594f="" class="table-actions-content"><span data-v-01af594f="" class="table-title">Table</span> <span data-v-868ea423="" data-v-01af594f=""><div data-v-1005b780="" data-v-868ea423="" class="icon-button" style="width: 32px; height: 32px;"><svg data-v-1005b780="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" role="img" class="iconify" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" name="Copy"><path d="M725.333333 302.933333a166.4 166.4 0 0 1 166.4 166.4v256a166.4 166.4 0 0 1-166.4 166.4h-256A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 302.933333 725.333333v-256A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 469.333333 302.933333h256z m-256 76.8A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 379.733333 469.333333v256c0 49.493333 40.106667 89.6 89.6 89.6h256a89.6 89.6 0 0 0 89.6-89.6v-256A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 725.333333 379.733333h-256z" fill="currentColor"></path><path d="M554.666667 132.266667a166.4 166.4 0 0 1 144.128 83.2 38.4 38.4 0 0 1-66.517334 38.4A89.514667 89.514667 0 0 0 554.666667 209.066667H298.666667A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 209.066667 298.666667v256c0 33.109333 17.92 62.08 44.8 77.653333a38.4 38.4 0 0 1-38.4 66.474667A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 132.266667 554.666667V298.666667A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 298.666667 132.266667h256z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg> <div data-v-5f9e9bf6="" data-v-1005b780="" class="kimi-tooltip tooltip-bottom icon-button-tooltip bottom">Copy</div></div></span> <div data-v-1005b780="" data-v-01af594f="" class="icon-button table-actions-icon" style="width: 32px; height: 32px;"><svg data-v-1005b780="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" role="img" class="iconify" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" name="Download"><path d="M512 126.976a36.864 36.864 0 0 1 36.864 36.864v347.91424l119.11168-119.11168a36.864 36.864 0 1 1 52.14208 52.14208l-182.0672 182.02624a36.864 36.864 0 0 1-52.10112 0l-182.0672-182.02624a36.864 36.864 0 0 1 52.14208-52.14208l119.11168 119.11168V163.84a36.864 36.864 0 0 1 36.864-36.864zM184.32 564.71552a36.864 36.864 0 0 1 36.864 36.864v145.65376a35.96288 35.96288 0 0 0 35.96288 35.96288h509.70624a35.96288 35.96288 0 0 0 35.96288-35.96288v-145.65376a36.864 36.864 0 0 1 73.728 0v145.65376a109.69088 109.69088 0 0 1-109.69088 109.69088H257.14688A109.69088 109.69088 0 0 1 147.456 747.23328v-145.65376a36.864 36.864 0 0 1 36.864-36.864z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg> <!----></div><!----></div></header></div></div></div> <div data-v-01af594f="" class="table-container"><table data-v-01af594f=""><thead data-v-01af594f=""><tr data-v-01af594f=""><th data-v-01af594f="" align="left">Windows Keep</th><th data-v-01af594f="" align="left">Shrink By</th><th data-v-01af594f="" align="left">Parrot Becomes</th></tr></thead> <tbody data-v-01af594f=""><tr data-v-01af594f=""><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left">120GB</td><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left">~48GB</td><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left">~100GB</td></tr><tr data-v-01af594f=""><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left">100GB</td><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left">~68GB</td><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left">~120GB</td></tr><tr data-v-01af594f=""><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left">80GB</td><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left">~88GB</td><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left">~140GB</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class="paragraph" dir="auto"><strong>How much space do you want for Windows?</strong> Then start with <strong>Step 1: Disable Fast Startup</strong>! 🚀</di