<div data-v-38e35b58="" class="chat-content-item chat-content-item-assistant" data-archer-id="19f5c932-5d92-8ca6-8000-0a1608b7d40c"><!----> <div data-v-a660adc4="" data-v-38e35b58="" class="segment segment-assistant"><div data-v-88be9e2e="" data-v-a660adc4="" class="segment-avatar"><div data-v-88be9e2e="" class="avatar"><canvas data-v-b81624a4="" data-v-88be9e2e="" style="width: 56px; height: 56px;" class="rive-container" width="112" height="112"></canvas></div></div> <div data-v-a660adc4="" class="segment-container" dir="auto"> <!----> <!----> <div data-v-a660adc4="" class="segment-content"><div data-v-a660adc4="" class="segment-content-box"> <!----> <div data-v-3b9ae98b="" data-v-d664c8c3="" class="markdown-container"><div data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="markdown"><div data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code"><div data-v-13fde6a9="" data-v-8d822fd1="" class="sticky-release" style="--sticky-header-height: 42.5px;"><div data-v-13fde6a9="" class="sticky-release-rail"><div data-v-13fde6a9="" class="sticky-release-header" style="top: 0px;"><header data-v-8d822fd1="" class="segment-code-header"><div data-v-8d822fd1="" class="segment-code-header-content"><span data-v-8d822fd1="" class="segment-code-lang">plain</span> <!----> <span data-v-868ea423="" data-v-8d822fd1=""><div data-v-1005b780="" data-v-868ea423="" class="icon-button" style="width: 32px; height: 32px;"><svg data-v-1005b780="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" role="img" class="iconify" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" name="Copy"><path d="M725.333333 302.933333a166.4 166.4 0 0 1 166.4 166.4v256a166.4 166.4 0 0 1-166.4 166.4h-256A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 302.933333 725.333333v-256A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 469.333333 302.933333h256z m-256 76.8A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 379.733333 469.333333v256c0 49.493333 40.106667 89.6 89.6 89.6h256a89.6 89.6 0 0 0 89.6-89.6v-256A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 725.333333 379.733333h-256z" fill="currentColor"></path><path d="M554.666667 132.266667a166.4 166.4 0 0 1 144.128 83.2 38.4 38.4 0 0 1-66.517334 38.4A89.514667 89.514667 0 0 0 554.666667 209.066667H298.666667A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 209.066667 298.666667v256c0 33.109333 17.92 62.08 44.8 77.653333a38.4 38.4 0 0 1-38.4 66.474667A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 132.266667 554.666667V298.666667A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 298.666667 132.266667h256z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg> <div data-v-5f9e9bf6="" data-v-1005b780="" class="kimi-tooltip tooltip-bottom icon-button-tooltip bottom">Copy</div></div></span></div></header></div></div></div> <div data-v-efb858b9="" data-v-8d822fd1="" class="syntax-highlighter dark segment-code-content"><pre data-v-efb858b9="" class="language-plain"><code class="language-plain">The "Could not find recovery environment" error means Windows can't find its own reset files. This happens when the recovery partition is missing or corrupted.</code></pre></div></div> <div data-v-d664c8c3=""></div><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Since resetting isn't working, let's go with <strong>Plan B: Don't reset Windows. Just shrink it directly.</strong></div><hr><h2>Plan B: Shrink Windows Without Resetting</h2><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Your Windows is <strong>168.4GB</strong> with your files on it. We can still shrink it safely.</div><h3>Step 1: Free Up Space in Windows First</h3><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Before shrinking, make Windows as small as possible:</div><ol start="1"><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto"><strong>Empty Recycle Bin</strong></div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto"><strong>Run Disk Cleanup:</strong></div><ul start="1"><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Press <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">Win + R</code>, type <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">cleanmgr</code>, press Enter</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Select <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">C:</code> drive</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Check all boxes (Temporary files, Downloads, etc.)</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Click <strong>OK → Delete Files</strong></div></li></ul></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto"><strong>Uninstall large apps/games</strong> you don't need</div></li></ol><h3>Step 2: Disable Fast Startup</h3><ol start="1"><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Open <strong>Control Panel</strong> → <strong>Power Options</strong></div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Click <strong>"Choose what the power buttons do"</strong></div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Click <strong>"Change settings that are currently unavailable"</strong></div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto"><strong>UNCHECK</strong> "Turn on fast startup (recommended)"</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Click <strong>Save changes</strong></div></li></ol><h3>Step 3: Shrink Windows Partition</h3><ol start="1"><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Press <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">Win + X</code> → <strong>Disk Management</strong></div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Right-click <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">C:</code> drive → <strong>Shrink Volume</strong></div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Windows will calculate available space</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Enter amount to shrink in MB:</div></li></ol><div data-v-01af594f="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="table markdown-table"><div data-v-13fde6a9="" data-v-01af594f="" class="sticky-release" style="--sticky-header-height: 42.5px;"><div data-v-13fde6a9="" class="sticky-release-rail"><div data-v-13fde6a9="" class="sticky-release-header" style="top: 0px;"><header data-v-01af594f="" class="table-actions"><div data-v-01af594f="" class="table-actions-content"><span data-v-01af594f="" class="table-title">Table</span> <span data-v-868ea423="" data-v-01af594f=""><div data-v-1005b780="" data-v-868ea423="" class="icon-button" style="width: 32px; height: 32px;"><svg data-v-1005b780="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" role="img" class="iconify" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" name="Copy"><path d="M725.333333 302.933333a166.4 166.4 0 0 1 166.4 166.4v256a166.4 166.4 0 0 1-166.4 166.4h-256A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 302.933333 725.333333v-256A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 469.333333 302.933333h256z m-256 76.8A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 379.733333 469.333333v256c0 49.493333 40.106667 89.6 89.6 89.6h256a89.6 89.6 0 0 0 89.6-89.6v-256A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 725.333333 379.733333h-256z" fill="currentColor"></path><path d="M554.666667 132.266667a166.4 166.4 0 0 1 144.128 83.2 38.4 38.4 0 0 1-66.517334 38.4A89.514667 89.514667 0 0 0 554.666667 209.066667H298.666667A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 209.066667 298.666667v256c0 33.109333 17.92 62.08 44.8 77.653333a38.4 38.4 0 0 1-38.4 66.474667A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 132.266667 554.666667V298.666667A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 298.666667 132.266667h256z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg> <div data-v-5f9e9bf6="" data-v-1005b780="" class="kimi-tooltip tooltip-bottom icon-button-tooltip bottom">Copy</div></div></span> <div data-v-1005b780="" data-v-01af594f="" class="icon-button table-actions-icon" style="width: 32px; height: 32px;"><svg data-v-1005b780="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" role="img" class="iconify" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" name="Download"><path d="M512 126.976a36.864 36.864 0 0 1 36.864 36.864v347.91424l119.11168-119.11168a36.864 36.864 0 1 1 52.14208 52.14208l-182.0672 182.02624a36.864 36.864 0 0 1-52.10112 0l-182.0672-182.02624a36.864 36.864 0 0 1 52.14208-52.14208l119.11168 119.11168V163.84a36.864 36.864 0 0 1 36.864-36.864zM184.32 564.71552a36.864 36.864 0 0 1 36.864 36.864v145.65376a35.96288 35.96288 0 0 0 35.96288 35.96288h509.70624a35.96288 35.96288 0 0 0 35.96288-35.96288v-145.65376a36.864 36.864 0 0 1 73.728 0v145.65376a109.69088 109.69088 0 0 1-109.69088 109.69088H257.14688A109.69088 109.69088 0 0 1 147.456 747.23328v-145.65376a36.864 36.864 0 0 1 36.864-36.864z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg> <!----></div><!----></div></header></div></div></div> <div data-v-01af594f="" class="table-container"><table data-v-01af594f=""><thead data-v-01af594f=""><tr data-v-01af594f=""><th data-v-01af594f="" align="left">Want for Parrot</th><th data-v-01af594f="" align="left">Enter this</th></tr></thead> <tbody data-v-01af594f=""><tr data-v-01af594f=""><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left">+40GB</td><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left"><code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">40960</code></td></tr><tr data-v-01af594f=""><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left">+60GB</td><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left"><code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">61440</code></td></tr><tr data-v-01af594f=""><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left">+80GB</td><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left"><code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">81920</code></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><ol start="5"><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Click <strong>Shrink</strong></div></li></ol><h3>Step 4: Expand Parrot with SystemRescue</h3><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Boot from your <strong>SystemRescue USB</strong>:</div><ol start="1"><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Restart, spam <strong>F12</strong>, select USB</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Type <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">startx</code> for GUI</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Open <strong>GParted</strong></div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Select <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">/dev/sda</code></div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Right-click <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">sda4</code> (52.2GB) → <strong>Resize/Move</strong></div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Drag right edge to fill unallocated space</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Click <strong>Resize/Move</strong> → Apply (green checkmark)</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Reboot, remove USB</div></li></ol><hr><h2>How Much Can You Shrink?</h2><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">The amount depends on how much free space Windows has. After Disk Cleanup, check how much free space <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">C:</code> has:</div><ul start="1"><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">If <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">C:</code> has <strong>100GB free</strong> → you can shrink by ~80GB safely</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">If <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">C:</code> has <strong>60GB free</strong> → you can shrink by ~40GB safely</div></li></ul><div class="paragraph" dir="auto"><strong>Run Disk Cleanup now, then check free space on C: drive. How much free space do you have?</strong> Then I'll tell you exactly how much to shrink! 🚀</div></div></div> <!----> <!----> <!----></div>  <!----> <!----> <!----> <!---->   <!----> <div data-v-38e35b58="" class="okc-cards-container"><!----> <!----> <!----> <!----> <!----></div> <!----> <!----> <!----> <div data-v-b1bd13bb="" data-v-a660adc4="" class="segment-assistant-actions"><div data-v-b1bd13bb="" class="segment-assistant-actions-content"> <!----> <!----> <!----><div data-v-1005b780="" data-v-b1bd13bb="" class="icon-button" style="width: 28px; height: 28px;"><svg data-v-1005b780="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" role="img" class="iconify" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" name="Copy"><path d="M725.333333 302.933333a166.4 166.4 0 0 1 166.4 166.4v256a166.4 166.4 0 0 1-166.4 166.4h-256A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 302.933333 725.333333v-256A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 469.333333 302.933333h256z m