dth="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" name="Share_a"><path d="M386.218667 247.850667c0-102.4 120.405333-157.397333 197.76-90.282667l304.426666 264.32a119.466667 119.466667 0 0 1 1.365334 179.285333l-304.469334 272.170667c-76.970667 68.778667-199.082667 14.122667-199.082666-89.088v-89.173333c-33.024 2.261333-59.306667 6.826667-83.2 15.36-30.592 10.88-61.866667 29.952-98.602667 67.712a76.8 76.8 0 0 1-131.84-53.504c0-98.645333 24.106667-190.976 83.712-261.888 55.253333-65.792 133.973333-104.789333 229.930667-117.845334V247.850667z m147.413333-32.256c-27.648-23.978667-70.613333-4.352-70.613333 32.256v126.208l-0.256 4.309333c-2.218667 21.504-20.437333 38.186667-42.410667 40.021333l-17.194667 1.706667c-173.994667 20.949333-253.824 136.405333-253.824 304.554667 86.997333-89.557333 163.925333-105.386667 270.933334-107.861334a42.026667 42.026667 0 0 1 42.752 42.24v125.226667c0 34.56 38.272 53.845333 65.706666 35.925333l5.376-4.096 304.426667-272.213333a42.666667 42.666667 0 0 0 2.986667-60.714667l-3.413334-3.285333-304.469333-264.277333z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg> <span data-v-351fdc4e="">Share</span></div> <!----></div> <!----></div>   <!----> <!----> <!----> <!----></div></div></div></div><div data-v-38e35b58="" class="chat-content-item chat-content-item-assistant" data-archer-id="19f5c948-0c32-88f4-8000-0a16be96aeaa"><!----> <div data-v-a660adc4="" data-v-38e35b58="" class="segment segment-assistant"><div data-v-88be9e2e="" data-v-a660adc4="" class="segment-avatar"><div data-v-88be9e2e="" class="avatar"><canvas data-v-b81624a4="" data-v-88be9e2e="" style="width: 56px; height: 56px;" class="rive-container" width="112" height="112"></canvas></div></div> <div data-v-a660adc4="" class="segment-container" dir="auto"> <!----> <!----> <div data-v-a660adc4="" class="segment-content"><div data-v-a660adc4="" class="segment-content-box"> <!----> <div data-v-3b9ae98b="" data-v-d664c8c3="" class="markdown-container"><div data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="markdown"><div data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code"><div data-v-13fde6a9="" data-v-8d822fd1="" class="sticky-release" style="--sticky-header-height: 42.5px;"><div data-v-13fde6a9="" class="sticky-release-rail"><div data-v-13fde6a9="" class="sticky-release-header" style="top: 0px;"><header data-v-8d822fd1="" class="segment-code-header"><div data-v-8d822fd1="" class="segment-code-header-content"><span data-v-8d822fd1="" class="segment-code-lang">plain</span> <!----> <span data-v-868ea423="" data-v-8d822fd1=""><div data-v-1005b780="" data-v-868ea423="" class="icon-button" style="width: 32px; height: 32px;"><svg data-v-1005b780="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" role="img" class="iconify" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" name="Copy"><path d="M725.333333 302.933333a166.4 166.4 0 0 1 166.4 166.4v256a166.4 166.4 0 0 1-166.4 166.4h-256A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 302.933333 725.333333v-256A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 469.333333 302.933333h256z m-256 76.8A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 379.733333 469.333333v256c0 49.493333 40.106667 89.6 89.6 89.6h256a89.6 89.6 0 0 0 89.6-89.6v-256A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 725.333333 379.733333h-256z" fill="currentColor"></path><path d="M554.666667 132.266667a166.4 166.4 0 0 1 144.128 83.2 38.4 38.4 0 0 1-66.517334 38.4A89.514667 89.514667 0 0 0 554.666667 209.066667H298.666667A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 209.066667 298.666667v256c0 33.109333 17.92 62.08 44.8 77.653333a38.4 38.4 0 0 1-38.4 66.474667A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 132.266667 554.666667V298.666667A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 298.666667 132.266667h256z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg> <div data-v-5f9e9bf6="" data-v-1005b780="" class="kimi-tooltip tooltip-bottom icon-button-tooltip bottom">Copy</div></div></span></div></header></div></div></div> <div data-v-efb858b9="" data-v-8d822fd1="" class="syntax-highlighter dark segment-code-content"><pre data-v-efb858b9="" class="language-plain"><code class="language-plain">When shrinking Windows isn't enough, you have a few options:</code></pre></div></div> <div data-v-d664c8c3=""></div><hr><h2>Option 1: Delete the 7.8GB Recovery Partition (<code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">sda5</code>)</h2><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">That <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">sda5</code> (7.8GB Microsoft basic data) is likely a Windows recovery partition. You can delete it and add that space to Parrot.</div><div class="paragraph" dir="auto"><strong>But first, check what <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">sda5</code> is:</strong></div><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">In Windows, open <strong>Disk Management</strong> and see if <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">sda5</code> shows as "Recovery Partition." If yes, you can delete it.</div><div class="paragraph" dir="auto"><strong>Steps:</strong></div><ol start="1"><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">In Windows Disk Management, right-click <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">sda5</code> → <strong>Delete Volume</strong></div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">This creates unallocated space</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Then shrink <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">C:</code> drive further if needed</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Boot SystemRescue → GParted → expand <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">sda4</code> into all unallocated space</div></li></ol><blockquote><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">⚠️ You won't be able to reset Windows in the future without recovery media.</div></blockquote><hr><h2>Option 2: Delete Windows Entirely</h2><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">If you barely use Windows, you could:</div><ol start="1"><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Delete <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">sda3</code> (Windows) and <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">sda5</code> (Recovery)</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Expand Parrot to fill everything (~228GB for Parrot!)</div></li></ol><div class="paragraph" dir="auto"><strong>This gives you a massive Parrot partition</strong> but no more dual-boot.</div><hr><h2>Option 3: Add a Second Hard Drive</h2><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">If your laptop has space for another drive (M.2 slot or 2.5" bay), you could:</div><ul start="1"><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Install a new SSD</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Move Windows to the new drive</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Use the entire current drive for Parrot</div></li></ul><hr><h2>Option 4: Clean Install Windows (Smaller)</h2><ol start="1"><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Download Windows ISO from Microsoft</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Create Windows bootable USB</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Delete <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">sda3</code> and <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">sda5</code> during install</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Install Windows in a smaller partition (e.g., 80GB)</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Boot SystemRescue → expand Parrot into the rest</div></li></ol><hr><h2>My Recommendation</h2><div class="paragraph" dir="auto"><strong>Option 1 first</strong> — delete the recovery partition (<code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">sda5</code>) and shrink Windows. That gives you ~7.8GB + whatever you can shrink from <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">C:</code>.</div><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">If that's still not enough, then consider <strong>Option 2</strong> (delete Windows entirely) if you don't need it.</div><hr><div class="paragraph" dir="auto"><strong>Which option sounds good to you?</strong> Or tell me: how much space do you want for Parrot, and how much do you actually use Windows? 🚀</div></div></div> <!----> <!----> <!----></div>  <!----> <!----> <!----> <!---->   <!----> <div data-v-38e35b58="" class="okc-cards-container"><!----> <!----> <!----> <!----> <!----></div> <!----> <!----> <!----> <div data-v-b1bd13bb="" data-v-a660adc4="" class="segment-assistant-actions"><div data-v-b1bd13bb="" class="segment-assistant-actions-content"> <!----> <!----> <!----><div data-v-1005b780="" data-v-b1bd13bb="" class="icon-button" style="width: 28px; height: 28px;"><svg data-v-1005b780="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" role="img" class="iconify" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" name="Copy"><path d="M725.333333 302.933333a166.4 166.4 0 0 1 166.4 166.4v256a166.4 166.4 0 0 1-166.4 166.4h-256A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 302.933333 725.333333v-256A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 469.333333 302.933333h256z m-256 76.8A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 379.733333 469.333333v256c0 49.493333 40.106667 89.6 89.6 89.6h256a89.6 89.6 0 0 0 89.6-89.6v-256A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 725.333333 379.733333h-256z" fill="currentColor"></path><path d="M554.666667 132.266667a166.4 166.4 0 0 1 144.128 83.2 38.4 38.4 0 0 1-66.517334 38.4A89.514667 89.514667 0 0 0 554.666667 209.066667H298.666667A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 209.066667 298.666667v256c0 33.109333 17.92 62.08 44.8 77.653333a38.4 38.4 0 0 1-38.4 66.474667A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 132.266667 554.666667V298.666667A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 298.666667 132.266667h256z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg> <!----></div><!----> <!----><div data-v-1005b780="" data-v-b1bd13bb="" class="icon-button" style="width: 28px; height: 28px;"><svg data-v-1005b780="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" role="img" class="iconify" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" name="Refresh"><path d="M303.104 315.392c114.688-114.688 303.104-114.688 417.792 0l-32.768 32.768c-20.48 20.48-4.096 57.344 24.576 57.344h1