 89.6 0 0 0 379.733333 469.333333v256c0 49.493333 40.106667 89.6 89.6 89.6h256a89.6 89.6 0 0 0 89.6-89.6v-256A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 725.333333 379.733333h-256z" fill="currentColor"></path><path d="M554.666667 132.266667a166.4 166.4 0 0 1 144.128 83.2 38.4 38.4 0 0 1-66.517334 38.4A89.514667 89.514667 0 0 0 554.666667 209.066667H298.666667A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 209.066667 298.666667v256c0 33.109333 17.92 62.08 44.8 77.653333a38.4 38.4 0 0 1-38.4 66.474667A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 132.266667 554.666667V298.666667A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 298.666667 132.266667h256z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg> <div data-v-5f9e9bf6="" data-v-1005b780="" class="kimi-tooltip tooltip-bottom icon-button-tooltip bottom">Copy</div></div></span></div></header></div></div></div> <div data-v-efb858b9="" data-v-8d822fd1="" class="syntax-highlighter dark segment-code-content"><pre data-v-efb858b9="" class="language-plain"><code class="language-plain">I can see the issue! Looking at AOMEI Partition Assistant:</code></pre></div></div> <div data-v-d664c8c3=""></div><div data-v-01af594f="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="table markdown-table"><div data-v-13fde6a9="" data-v-01af594f="" class="sticky-release" style="--sticky-header-height: 42.5px;"><div data-v-13fde6a9="" class="sticky-release-rail"><div data-v-13fde6a9="" class="sticky-release-header" style="top: 0px;"><header data-v-01af594f="" class="table-actions"><div data-v-01af594f="" class="table-actions-content"><span data-v-01af594f="" class="table-title">Table</span> <span data-v-868ea423="" data-v-01af594f=""><div data-v-1005b780="" data-v-868ea423="" class="icon-button" style="width: 32px; height: 32px;"><svg data-v-1005b780="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" role="img" class="iconify" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" name="Copy"><path d="M725.333333 302.933333a166.4 166.4 0 0 1 166.4 166.4v256a166.4 166.4 0 0 1-166.4 166.4h-256A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 302.933333 725.333333v-256A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 469.333333 302.933333h256z m-256 76.8A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 379.733333 469.333333v256c0 49.493333 40.106667 89.6 89.6 89.6h256a89.6 89.6 0 0 0 89.6-89.6v-256A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 725.333333 379.733333h-256z" fill="currentColor"></path><path d="M554.666667 132.266667a166.4 166.4 0 0 1 144.128 83.2 38.4 38.4 0 0 1-66.517334 38.4A89.514667 89.514667 0 0 0 554.666667 209.066667H298.666667A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 209.066667 298.666667v256c0 33.109333 17.92 62.08 44.8 77.653333a38.4 38.4 0 0 1-38.4 66.474667A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 132.266667 554.666667V298.666667A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 298.666667 132.266667h256z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg> <div data-v-5f9e9bf6="" data-v-1005b780="" class="kimi-tooltip tooltip-bottom icon-button-tooltip bottom">Copy</div></div></span> <div data-v-1005b780="" data-v-01af594f="" class="icon-button table-actions-icon" style="width: 32px; height: 32px;"><svg data-v-1005b780="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" role="img" class="iconify" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" name="Download"><path d="M512 126.976a36.864 36.864 0 0 1 36.864 36.864v347.91424l119.11168-119.11168a36.864 36.864 0 1 1 52.14208 52.14208l-182.0672 182.02624a36.864 36.864 0 0 1-52.10112 0l-182.0672-182.02624a36.864 36.864 0 0 1 52.14208-52.14208l119.11168 119.11168V163.84a36.864 36.864 0 0 1 36.864-36.864zM184.32 564.71552a36.864 36.864 0 0 1 36.864 36.864v145.65376a35.96288 35.96288 0 0 0 35.96288 35.96288h509.70624a35.96288 35.96288 0 0 0 35.96288-35.96288v-145.65376a36.864 36.864 0 0 1 73.728 0v145.65376a109.69088 109.69088 0 0 1-109.69088 109.69088H257.14688A109.69088 109.69088 0 0 1 147.456 747.23328v-145.65376a36.864 36.864 0 0 1 36.864-36.864z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg> <!----></div><!----></div></header></div></div></div> <div data-v-01af594f="" class="table-container"><table data-v-01af594f=""><thead data-v-01af594f=""><tr data-v-01af594f=""><th data-v-01af594f="" align="left">Partition</th><th data-v-01af594f="" align="left">What AOMEI Shows</th><th data-v-01af594f="" align="left">Actual</th></tr></thead> <tbody data-v-01af594f=""><tr data-v-01af594f=""><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left"><code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">C:</code></td><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left">168.44GB NTFS</td><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left">✅ Windows</td></tr><tr data-v-01af594f=""><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left"><code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">*:</code> (52.19GB)</td><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left"><strong data-v-01af594f="">Other</strong> with ❌ error</td><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left"><strong data-v-01af594f="">This should be your Parrot BTRFS</strong></td></tr><tr data-v-01af594f=""><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left"><code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">I: ISO1</code></td><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left">7.81GB NTFS</td><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left">Recovery partition</td></tr><tr data-v-01af594f=""><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left"><code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">*</code> (9.92GB)</td><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left">Unallocated</td><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left">Free space</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class="paragraph" dir="auto"><strong>AOMEI shows your Parrot partition as "Other" with an error</strong> because <strong>AOMEI Partition Assistant Standard (free version) does NOT support BTRFS filesystem!</strong></div><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">It can't read BTRFS, so it shows:</div><ul start="1"><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Type: "Other"</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Used Space: 0.00KB (100% free) — <strong>WRONG!</strong></div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Status: Error icon ❌</div></li></ul><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Your Parrot data is <strong>still there and safe</strong> — AOMEI just can't see it because it doesn't understand BTRFS.</div><hr><h2>Why This Happens</h2><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">AOMEI Standard Edition supports:</div><ul start="1"><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">✅ NTFS, FAT32, exFAT</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">✅ EXT2/3/4 (Linux)</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">❌ <strong>BTRFS</strong> (not supported in free version)</div></li></ul><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Parrot OS uses <strong>BTRFS</strong> as its root filesystem, so AOMEI thinks it's an unknown/empty partition.</div><hr><h2>What You Should Use Instead</h2><div data-v-01af594f="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="table markdown-table"><div data-v-13fde6a9="" data-v-01af594f="" class="sticky-release" style="--sticky-header-height: 42.5px;"><div data-v-13fde6a9="" class="sticky-release-rail"><div data-v-13fde6a9="" class="sticky-release-header" style="top: 0px;"><header data-v-01af594f="" class="table-actions"><div data-v-01af594f="" class="table-actions-content"><span data-v-01af594f="" class="table-title">Table</span> <span data-v-868ea423="" data-v-01af594f=""><div data-v-1005b780="" data-v-868ea423="" class="icon-button" style="width: 32px; height: 32px;"><svg data-v-1005b780="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" role="img" class="iconify" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" name="Copy"><path d="M725.333333 302.933333a166.4 166.4 0 0 1 166.4 166.4v256a166.4 166.4 0 0 1-166.4 166.4h-256A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 302.933333 725.333333v-256A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 469.333333 302.933333h256z m-256 76.8A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 379.733333 469.333333v256c0 49.493333 40.106667 89.6 89.6 89.6h256a89.6 89.6 0 0 0 89.6-89.6v-256A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 725.333333 379.733333h-256z" fill="currentColor"></path><path d="M554.666667 132.266667a166.4 166.4 0 0 1 144.128 83.2 38.4 38.4 0 0 1-66.517334 38.4A89.514667 89.514667 0 0 0 554.666667 209.066667H298.666667A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 209.066667 298.666667v256c0 33.109333 17.92 62.08 44.8 77.653333a38.4 38.4 0 0 1-38.4 66.474667A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 132.266667 554.666667V298.666667A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 298.666667 132.266667h256z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg> <div data-v-5f9e9bf6="" data-v-1005b780="" class="kimi-tooltip tooltip-bottom icon-button-tooltip bottom">Copy</div></div></span> <div data-v-1005b780="" data-v-01af594f="" class="icon-button table-actions-icon" style="width: 32px; height: 32px;"><svg data-v-1005b780="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" role="img" class="iconify" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" name="Download"><path d="M512 126.976a36.864 36.864 0 0 1 36.864 36.864v347.91424l119.11168-119.11168a36.864 36.864 0 1 1 52.14208 52.14208l-182.0672 182.02624a36.864 36.864 0 0 1-52.10112 0l-182.0672-182.02624a36.864 36.864 0 0 1 52.14208-52.14208l119.11168 119.11168V163.84a36.864 36.864 0 0 1 36.864-36.864zM184.32 564.71552a36.864 36.864 0 0 1 36.864 36.864v145.65376a35.96288 35.96288 0 0 0 35.96288 35.96288h509.70624a35.96288 35.96288 0 0 0 35.96288-35.96288v-145.65376a36.864 36.864 0 0 1 73.728 0v145.65376a109.69088 109.69088 0 0 1-109.69088 109.69088H257.14688A109.69088 109.69088 0 0 1 147.456 747.23328v-145.65376a36.864 36.864 0 0 1 36.864-36.864z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg> <!----></div><!----></div></header></div></div></div> <div data-v-01af594f="" class="table-container"><table data-v-01af594f=""><thead data-v-01af594f=""><tr data-v-01af594f=""><th data-v-01af594f="" align="left">Tool</th><th data-v-01af594f="" align="left">Supports BTRFS?</th><th data-v-01af594f="" align="left">Best For</th></tr></thead> <tbody data-v-01af594f=""><tr data-v-01af594f=""><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left"><strong data-v-01af594f="">GParted</strong> (SystemRescue)</td><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left">✅ Yes</td><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left">Resizing, viewing</td></tr><tr data-v-01af594f=""><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left"><strong data-v-01af594f="">KDE Partition Manager</strong> (in Parrot)</td><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left">✅ Yes</td><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left">Viewing</td></tr><tr data-v-01af594f=""><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left"><strong data-v-01af594f="">AOMEI Partition Assistant Pro</strong></td><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left">✅ Yes</td><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left">But costs money</td></tr><tr data-v-01af594f=""><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left"><strong data-v-01af594f="">DiskGenius</strong></td><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left">✅ Yes</td><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left">Free version works</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><hr><h2>Check Your Parrot Data is Safe</h2><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Boot into <strong>Parrot OS</strong> and run:</div><div data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code"><div data-v-13fde6a9="" data-v-8d822fd1="" class="sticky-release" style="--sticky-header-height: 42.5px;"><div data-v-13fde6a9="" class="sticky-release-rail"><div data-v-13fde6a9="" class="sticky-release-header" style="top: 0px;"><header data-v-8d822fd1="" class="segment-code-header"><div data-v-8d822fd1="" class="segment-code-header-content"><span data-v-8d822fd1="" class="segment-code-lang">bash</span> <!----> <span data-v-868ea423="" data-v-8d822fd1=""><div data-v-1005b780="" data-v-868ea423="" class="icon-button" style="width: 32px; height: 32px;"><svg data-v-1005b780="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" role="img" class="iconify" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" name="Copy"><path d="M725.333333 302.933333a166.4 166.4 0 0 1 166.4 166.4v256a166.4 166.4 0 0 1-166.4 166.4h-256A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 302.933333 725.333333v-256A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 469.333333 302.933333h256z m-256 76.8A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 379.733333 469.333333v256c0 49.493333 40.106667 89.6 89.6 89.6h256a89.6 89.6 0 0 0 89.6-89.6v-256A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 725.333333 379.733333h-256z" fill="currentColor"></path><path d="M554.666667 132.266667a166.4 166.4 0 0 1 144.128 83.2 38.4 38.4 0 0 1-66.517334 38.4A89.514667 89.514667 0 0 0 554.666667 209.066667H298.666667A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 209.066667 298.666667v256c0 33.109333 17.92 62.08 44.8 77.653333a38.4 38.4 0 0 1-38.4 66.474667A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 132.266667 554.666667V298.666667A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 298.666667 132.266667h256z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg> <div data-v-5f9e9bf6="" data-v-1005b780="" class="kimi-tooltip tooltip-bottom icon-button-tooltip bottom">Copy</div></div></span></div></header></div></div></div> <div data-v-efb858b9="" data-v-8d822fd1="" class="syntax-highlighter dark segment-code-content"><pre data-v-efb858b9="" class="language-bash"><code class="language-bash"><span class="token function">df</span> <span class="token parameter variable">-h</span></code></pre></div></div> <div data-v-d664c8c3=""></div><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">You'll see your <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">/</code> partition is actually full of data — AOMEI just can't read it.</div><hr><h2>For Resizing Parrot</h2><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Use <strong>GParted from SystemRescue USB</strong> — it fully supports BTRFS and can resize it safely.</div><hr><div class="paragraph" dir="auto"><strong>So to answer your question:</strong> Your 52GB is <strong>being used</strong> (full of Parrot OS files). AOMEI just lies and says "0.00KB used" because it can't read BTRFS! 🚀</div></div></div> <!----> <!----> <!----></div>  <!----> <!----> <!----> <!---->   <!----> <div data-v-38e35b58="" class="okc-cards-container"><!----> <!----> <!----> <!----> <!----></div> <!----> <!----> <!----> <div data-v-b1bd13bb="" data-v-a660adc4="" class="segment-assistant-actions"><div data-v-b1bd13bb="" class="segment-assistant-actions-content"> <!----> <!----> <!----><div data-v-1005b780="" data-v-b1bd13bb="" class="icon-button" style="width: 28px; height: 28px;"><svg data-v-1005b780="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" role="img" class="iconify" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" name="Copy"