atar"><div data-v-88be9e2e="" class="avatar"><canvas data-v-b81624a4="" data-v-88be9e2e="" style="width: 56px; height: 56px;" class="rive-container" width="112" height="112"></canvas></div></div> <div data-v-a660adc4="" class="segment-container" dir="auto"> <!----> <!----> <div data-v-a660adc4="" class="segment-content"><div data-v-a660adc4="" class="segment-content-box"> <!----> <div data-v-3b9ae98b="" data-v-d664c8c3="" class="markdown-container"><div data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="markdown"><div data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code"><div data-v-13fde6a9="" data-v-8d822fd1="" class="sticky-release" style="--sticky-header-height: 42.5px;"><div data-v-13fde6a9="" class="sticky-release-rail"><div data-v-13fde6a9="" class="sticky-release-header" style="top: 0px;"><header data-v-8d822fd1="" class="segment-code-header"><div data-v-8d822fd1="" class="segment-code-header-content"><span data-v-8d822fd1="" class="segment-code-lang">plain</span> <!----> <span data-v-868ea423="" data-v-8d822fd1=""><div data-v-1005b780="" data-v-868ea423="" class="icon-button" style="width: 32px; height: 32px;"><svg data-v-1005b780="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" role="img" class="iconify" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" name="Copy"><path d="M725.333333 302.933333a166.4 166.4 0 0 1 166.4 166.4v256a166.4 166.4 0 0 1-166.4 166.4h-256A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 302.933333 725.333333v-256A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 469.333333 302.933333h256z m-256 76.8A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 379.733333 469.333333v256c0 49.493333 40.106667 89.6 89.6 89.6h256a89.6 89.6 0 0 0 89.6-89.6v-256A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 725.333333 379.733333h-256z" fill="currentColor"></path><path d="M554.666667 132.266667a166.4 166.4 0 0 1 144.128 83.2 38.4 38.4 0 0 1-66.517334 38.4A89.514667 89.514667 0 0 0 554.666667 209.066667H298.666667A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 209.066667 298.666667v256c0 33.109333 17.92 62.08 44.8 77.653333a38.4 38.4 0 0 1-38.4 66.474667A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 132.266667 554.666667V298.666667A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 298.666667 132.266667h256z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg> <div data-v-5f9e9bf6="" data-v-1005b780="" class="kimi-tooltip tooltip-bottom icon-button-tooltip bottom">Copy</div></div></span></div></header></div></div></div> <div data-v-efb858b9="" data-v-8d822fd1="" class="syntax-highlighter dark segment-code-content"><pre data-v-efb858b9="" class="language-plain"><code class="language-plain">I can see the issue! Your USB (Disk 1) shows:</code></pre></div></div> <div data-v-d664c8c3=""></div><ul start="1"><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto"><strong>1 MB</strong> — Healthy (small partition)</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto"><strong>58.59 GB</strong> — <strong>Unallocated</strong></div></li></ul><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">The USB is showing as <strong>completely unallocated</strong> — the filesystem is gone! This means the USB was either:</div><ul start="1"><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Accidentally formatted/erased</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Corrupted</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">The partition table was damaged</div></li></ul><hr><h2>The Bad News</h2><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Your files on the USB are <strong>not accessible</strong> through normal means. The 17GB of data you backed up is in that unallocated space.</div><hr><h2>The Good News</h2><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">The data might still be <strong>recoverable</strong> with data recovery software!</div><hr><h2>Recover Your Files</h2><h3>Option 1: Use Recuva (Free, Easy)</h3><ol start="1"><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Download <strong>Recuva</strong> from <a data-v-3b9ae98b="" target="_blank" href="https://www.ccleaner.com/recuva" rel="noreferrer nofollow noopener">ccleaner.com/recuva</a></div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Install and run it</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Select your USB drive</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Choose <strong>Deep Scan</strong></div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Wait and see if it finds your files</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Recover them to your <strong>C: drive</strong> (NOT back to the USB!)</div></li></ol><h3>Option 2: Use TestDisk (Free, More Powerful)</h3><ol start="1"><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Download <strong>TestDisk</strong> from <a data-v-3b9ae98b="" target="_blank" href="https://www.cgsecurity.org/wiki/TestDisk_Download" rel="noreferrer nofollow noopener">cgsecurity.org</a></div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Run it and select your USB</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Choose <strong>Intel/PC partition</strong></div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Select <strong>Analyse</strong> → <strong>Quick Search</strong></div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">If it finds your old partition, select it and <strong>Write</strong> the partition table back</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Your files should reappear!</div></li></ol><hr><h2>My Recommendation</h2><div class="paragraph" dir="auto"><strong>Try Recuva first</strong> — it's simpler. If it finds your files, great! If not, try TestDisk.</div><hr><h2>After Recovery</h2><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Once you recover those 17GB of files to your C: drive, you can:</div><ol start="1"><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto"><strong>Move them to an external/cloud storage</strong></div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto"><strong>Delete them from C:</strong> to free up 17GB more</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Then shrink C: by another 17GB and add it to Parrot!</div></li></ol><div class="paragraph" dir="auto"><strong>Want me to walk you through Recuva or TestDisk?</strong> Or do you have those 17GB of files somewhere else already? 🚀</div></div></div> <!----> <!----> <!----></div>  <!----> <!----> <!----> <!---->   <!----> <div data-v-38e35b58="" class="okc-cards-container"><!----> <!----> <!----> <!----> <!----></div> <!----> <!----> <!----> <div data-v-b1bd13bb="" data-v-a660adc4="" class="segment-assistant-actions"><div data-v-b1bd13bb="" class="segment-assistant-actions-content"> <!----> <!----> <!----><div data-v-1005b780="" data-v-b1bd13bb="" class="icon-button" style="width: 28px; height: 28px;"><svg data-v-1005b780="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" role="img" class="iconify" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" name="Copy"><path d="M725.333333 302.933333a166.4 166.4 0 0 1 166.4 166.4v256a166.4 166.4 0 0 1-166.4 166.4h-256A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 302.933333 725.333333v-256A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 469.333333 302.933333h256z m-256 76.8A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 379.733333 469.333333v256c0 49.493333 40.106667 89.6 89.6 89.6h256a89.6 89.6 0 0 0 89.6-89.6v-256A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 725.333333 379.733333h-256z" fill="currentColor"></path><path d="M554.666667 132.266667a166.4 166.4 0 0 1 144.128 83.2 38.4 38.4 0 0 1-66.517334 38.4A89.514667 89.514667 0 0 0 554.666667 209.066667H298.666667A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 209.066667 298.666667v256c0 33.109333 17.92 62.08 44.8 77.653333a38.4 38.4 0 0 1-38.4 66.474667A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 132.266667 554.666667V298.666667A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 298.666667 132.266667h256z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg> <!----></div><!----> <!----><div data-v-1005b780="" data-v-b1bd13bb="" class="icon-button" style="width: 28px; height: 28px;"><svg data-v-1005b780="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" role="img" class="iconify" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" name="Refresh"><path d="M303.104 315.392c114.688-114.688 303.104-114.688 417.792 0l-32.768 32.768c-20.48 20.48-4.096 57.344 24.576 57.344h118.784c16.384 0 32.768-16.384 32.768-32.768V253.952c0-28.672-36.864-45.056-57.344-24.576l-32.768 32.768c-143.36-143.36-376.832-143.36-520.192 0s-143.36 376.832 0 520.192 376.832 143.36 520.192 0c49.152-49.152 77.824-106.496 94.208-163.84 4.096-20.48-8.192-40.96-24.576-45.056-20.48-4.0