her-id="19f5cf4a-bda2-8286-8000-0a162287ecec"><!----> <div data-v-a660adc4="" data-v-38e35b58="" class="segment segment-assistant"><div data-v-88be9e2e="" data-v-a660adc4="" class="segment-avatar"><div data-v-88be9e2e="" class="avatar"><canvas data-v-b81624a4="" data-v-88be9e2e="" style="width: 56px; height: 56px;" class="rive-container" width="112" height="112"></canvas></div></div> <div data-v-a660adc4="" class="segment-container" dir="auto"> <!----> <!----> <div data-v-a660adc4="" class="segment-content"><div data-v-a660adc4="" class="segment-content-box"> <!----> <div data-v-3b9ae98b="" data-v-d664c8c3="" class="markdown-container"><div data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="markdown"><div data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code"><div data-v-13fde6a9="" data-v-8d822fd1="" class="sticky-release" style="--sticky-header-height: 42.5px;"><div data-v-13fde6a9="" class="sticky-release-rail"><div data-v-13fde6a9="" class="sticky-release-header" style="top: 0px;"><header data-v-8d822fd1="" class="segment-code-header"><div data-v-8d822fd1="" class="segment-code-header-content"><span data-v-8d822fd1="" class="segment-code-lang">plain</span> <!----> <span data-v-868ea423="" data-v-8d822fd1=""><div data-v-1005b780="" data-v-868ea423="" class="icon-button" style="width: 32px; height: 32px;"><svg data-v-1005b780="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" role="img" class="iconify" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" name="Copy"><path d="M725.333333 302.933333a166.4 166.4 0 0 1 166.4 166.4v256a166.4 166.4 0 0 1-166.4 166.4h-256A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 302.933333 725.333333v-256A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 469.333333 302.933333h256z m-256 76.8A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 379.733333 469.333333v256c0 49.493333 40.106667 89.6 89.6 89.6h256a89.6 89.6 0 0 0 89.6-89.6v-256A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 725.333333 379.733333h-256z" fill="currentColor"></path><path d="M554.666667 132.266667a166.4 166.4 0 0 1 144.128 83.2 38.4 38.4 0 0 1-66.517334 38.4A89.514667 89.514667 0 0 0 554.666667 209.066667H298.666667A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 209.066667 298.666667v256c0 33.109333 17.92 62.08 44.8 77.653333a38.4 38.4 0 0 1-38.4 66.474667A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 132.266667 554.666667V298.666667A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 298.666667 132.266667h256z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg> <div data-v-5f9e9bf6="" data-v-1005b780="" class="kimi-tooltip tooltip-bottom icon-button-tooltip bottom">Copy</div></div></span></div></header></div></div></div> <div data-v-efb858b9="" data-v-8d822fd1="" class="syntax-highlighter dark segment-code-content"><pre data-v-efb858b9="" class="language-plain"><code class="language-plain">Great! After downloading Recuva, follow these steps:</code></pre></div></div> <div data-v-d664c8c3=""></div><hr><h2>Step 1: Install Recuva</h2><ol start="1"><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Run the Recuva installer</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Click <strong>Install</strong> (keep default settings)</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Click <strong>Run Recuva</strong> when done</div></li></ol><hr><h2>Step 2: Start the Recovery Wizard</h2><ol start="1"><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Recuva opens with a wizard — click <strong>Next</strong></div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Select <strong>"All files"</strong> (or specific type if you know)</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Click <strong>Next</strong></div></li></ol><hr><h2>Step 3: Select Your USB Drive</h2><ol start="1"><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Choose <strong>"In a specific location"</strong></div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Click <strong>Browse</strong></div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Select your <strong>USB drive</strong> (should show as a drive letter or "Removable Disk")</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Click <strong>OK</strong> → <strong>Next</strong></div></li></ol><hr><h2>Step 4: Enable Deep Scan</h2><ol start="1"><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Check the box <strong>"Enable Deep Scan"</strong></div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Click <strong>Start</strong></div></li></ol><blockquote><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">⏱️ Deep Scan takes 10-30 minutes depending on USB size</div></blockquote><hr><h2>Step 5: Recover Files</h2><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">When scan finishes:</div><ol start="1"><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">You'll see a list of found files</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Green = Excellent chance of recovery</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Orange = Good chance</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Red = Poor chance</div></li></ol><div class="paragraph" dir="auto"><strong>Select the files you want</strong> (or Ctrl+A to select all), then:</div><ol start="1"><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Click <strong>Recover</strong></div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Choose a <strong>destination on your C: drive</strong> (create a folder like <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">C:\Recovered</code>)</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto"><strong>NEVER recover to the USB itself!</strong></div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Click <strong>OK</strong></div></li></ol><hr><h2>Step 6: Check Recovered Files</h2><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Open <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">C:\Recovered</code> and verify your files are there and working.</div><hr><h2>After Recovery</h2><ol start="1"><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">If files are good → <strong>move them to cloud/external storage</strong></div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto"><strong>Delete them from C:</strong> to free up space</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Then we can shrink C: and expand Parrot!</div></li></ol><hr><div class="paragraph" dir="auto"><strong>Start the Recuva wizard and tell me what you see!</strong> 🚀</div></div></div> <!----> <!----> <!----></div>  <!----> <!----> <!----> <!---->   <!----> <div data-v-38e35b58="" class="okc-cards-container"><!----> <!----> <!----> <!----> <!----></div> <!----> <!----> <!----> <div data-v-b1bd13bb="" data-v-a660adc4="" class="segment-assistant-actions"><div data-v-b1bd13bb="" class="segment-assistant-actions-content"> <!----> <!----> <!----><div data-v-1005b780="" data-v-b1bd13bb="" class="icon-button" style="width: 28px; height: 28px;"><svg data-v-1005b780="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" role="img" class="iconify" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" name="Copy"><path d="M725.333333 302.933333a166.4 166.4 0 0 1 166.4 166.4v256a166.4 166.4 0 0 1-166.4 166.4h-256A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 302.933333 725.333333v-256A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 469.333333 302.933333h256z m-256 76.8A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 379.733333 469.333333v256c0 49.493333 40.106667 89.6 89.6 89.6h256a89.6 89.6 0 0 0 89.6-89.6v-256A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 725.333333 379.733333h-256z" fill="currentColor"></path><path d="M554.666667 132.266667a166.4 166.4 0 0 1 144.128 83.2 38.4 38.4 0 0 1-66.517334 38.4A89.514667 89.514667 0 0 0 554.666667 209.066667H298.666667A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 209.066667 298.666667v256c0 33.109333 17.92 62.08 44.8 77.653333a38.4 38.4 0 0 1-38.4 66.474667A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 132.266667 554.666667V298.666667A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 298.666667 132.266667h256z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg> <!----></div><!----> <!----><div data-v-1005b780="" data-v-b1bd13bb="" class="icon-button" style="width: 28px; height: 28px;"><svg data-v-1005b780="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" role="img" class="iconify" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" name="Refresh"><path d="M303.104 315.392c114.688-114.688 303.104-114.688 417.792 0l-32.768 32.768c-20.48 20.48-4.096 57.344 24.576 57.344h118.784c16.384 0 32.768-16.384 32.768-32.768V253.952c0-28.672-36.864-45.056-57.344-24.576l-32.768 32.768c-143.36-143.36-376.832-143.36-520.192 0s-143.36 376.832 0 520.192 376.83