20" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" name="Copy"><path d="M725.333333 302.933333a166.4 166.4 0 0 1 166.4 166.4v256a166.4 166.4 0 0 1-166.4 166.4h-256A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 302.933333 725.333333v-256A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 469.333333 302.933333h256z m-256 76.8A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 379.733333 469.333333v256c0 49.493333 40.106667 89.6 89.6 89.6h256a89.6 89.6 0 0 0 89.6-89.6v-256A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 725.333333 379.733333h-256z" fill="currentColor"></path><path d="M554.666667 132.266667a166.4 166.4 0 0 1 144.128 83.2 38.4 38.4 0 0 1-66.517334 38.4A89.514667 89.514667 0 0 0 554.666667 209.066667H298.666667A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 209.066667 298.666667v256c0 33.109333 17.92 62.08 44.8 77.653333a38.4 38.4 0 0 1-38.4 66.474667A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 132.266667 554.666667V298.666667A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 298.666667 132.266667h256z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg> <div data-v-5f9e9bf6="" data-v-1005b780="" class="kimi-tooltip tooltip-bottom icon-button-tooltip bottom">Copy</div></div></span></div></header></div></div></div> <div data-v-efb858b9="" data-v-8d822fd1="" class="syntax-highlighter dark segment-code-content"><pre data-v-efb858b9="" class="language-plain"><code class="language-plain">You're on the "File location" step. You need to select your **USB drive**, not C:\.</code></pre></div></div> <div data-v-d664c8c3=""></div><ol start="1"><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Click <strong>"On my media card or iPod"</strong> (this searches removable drives like your USB)</div><ul start="1"><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">OR click <strong>"Browse..."</strong> and select your USB drive from the list</div></li></ul></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Click <strong>Next &gt;</strong></div></li></ol><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">On the next screen, make sure to <strong>check "Enable Deep Scan"</strong> before starting!</div><div class="paragraph" dir="auto"><strong>Click "On my media card or iPod" now, then Next.</strong> 🚀</div></div></div> <!----> <!----> <!----></div>  <!----> <!----> <!----> <!----