4="" data-v-38e35b58="" class="segment segment-assistant"><div data-v-88be9e2e="" data-v-a660adc4="" class="segment-avatar"><div data-v-88be9e2e="" class="avatar"><canvas data-v-b81624a4="" data-v-88be9e2e="" style="width: 56px; height: 56px;" class="rive-container" width="112" height="112"></canvas></div></div> <div data-v-a660adc4="" class="segment-container" dir="auto"> <!----> <!----> <div data-v-a660adc4="" class="segment-content"><div data-v-a660adc4="" class="segment-content-box"> <!----> <div data-v-3b9ae98b="" data-v-d664c8c3="" class="markdown-container"><div data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="markdown"><div data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code"><div data-v-13fde6a9="" data-v-8d822fd1="" class="sticky-release" style="--sticky-header-height: 42.5px;"><div data-v-13fde6a9="" class="sticky-release-rail"><div data-v-13fde6a9="" class="sticky-release-header" style="top: 0px;"><header data-v-8d822fd1="" class="segment-code-header"><div data-v-8d822fd1="" class="segment-code-header-content"><span data-v-8d822fd1="" class="segment-code-lang">plain</span> <!----> <span data-v-868ea423="" data-v-8d822fd1=""><div data-v-1005b780="" data-v-868ea423="" class="icon-button" style="width: 32px; height: 32px;"><svg data-v-1005b780="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" role="img" class="iconify" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" name="Copy"><path d="M725.333333 302.933333a166.4 166.4 0 0 1 166.4 166.4v256a166.4 166.4 0 0 1-166.4 166.4h-256A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 302.933333 725.333333v-256A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 469.333333 302.933333h256z m-256 76.8A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 379.733333 469.333333v256c0 49.493333 40.106667 89.6 89.6 89.6h256a89.6 89.6 0 0 0 89.6-89.6v-256A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 725.333333 379.733333h-256z" fill="currentColor"></path><path d="M554.666667 132.266667a166.4 166.4 0 0 1 144.128 83.2 38.4 38.4 0 0 1-66.517334 38.4A89.514667 89.514667 0 0 0 554.666667 209.066667H298.666667A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 209.066667 298.666667v256c0 33.109333 17.92 62.08 44.8 77.653333a38.4 38.4 0 0 1-38.4 66.474667A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 132.266667 554.666667V298.666667A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 298.666667 132.266667h256z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg> <div data-v-5f9e9bf6="" data-v-1005b780="" class="kimi-tooltip tooltip-bottom icon-button-tooltip bottom">Copy</div></div></span></div></header></div></div></div> <div data-v-efb858b9="" data-v-8d822fd1="" class="syntax-highlighter dark segment-code-content"><pre data-v-efb858b9="" class="language-plain"><code class="language-plain">Good call! Let's try **TestDisk** — it's more powerful for recovering lost partitions.</code></pre></div></div> <div data-v-d664c8c3=""></div><hr><h2>Step 1: Download TestDisk</h2><ol start="1"><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Go to <a data-v-3b9ae98b="" target="_blank" href="https://www.cgsecurity.org/wiki/TestDisk_Download" rel="noreferrer nofollow noopener">cgsecurity.org/wiki/TestDisk_Download</a></div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Download <strong>TestDisk &amp; PhotoRec</strong> (the ZIP file)</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Extract the ZIP to your Desktop (right-click → Extract All)</div></li></ol><hr><h2>Step 2: Run TestDisk</h2><ol start="1"><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Open the extracted folder</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Run <strong>testdisk_win.exe</strong> (64-bit) or <strong>testdisk.exe</strong> (32-bit)</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">It opens in a black command window</div></li></ol><hr><h2>Step 3: Follow the Steps</h2><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">You'll see a menu. Use <strong>Arrow keys</strong> to navigate, <strong>Enter</strong> to select.</div><ol start="1"><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Select <strong>Create</strong> (create new log file) → Press Enter</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Select your <strong>USB drive</strong> (should show as 58GB) → Press Enter</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Select <strong>Intel/PC partition</strong> → Press Enter</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Select <strong>Analyse</strong> → Press Enter</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Select <strong>Quick Search</strong> → Press Enter</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Wait for it to scan...</div></li></ol><hr><h2>Step 4: If It Finds Your Old Partition</h2><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">If TestDisk finds your old partition:</div><ul start="1"><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">It will show as something like <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">FAT32</code> or <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">NTFS</code></div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Highlight it with arrow keys</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Press <strong>P</strong> to list files (verify they're yours)</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">If files look correct, press <strong>Enter</strong> to select</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Then select <strong>Write</strong> to restore the partition table</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Confirm <strong>Yes</strong></div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Reboot</div></li></ul><hr><h2>Step 5: Check Your USB</h2><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">After reboot, your USB should show up in Windows with all your files!</div><hr><div class="paragraph" dir="auto"><strong>Start TestDisk now and tell me what you see at Step 3 (the drive list)!</strong> 🚀</div></div></div> <!----> <!----> <!----></div>  <!----> <!----> <!----> <!---->   <!----> <div data-v-38e35b58="" class="okc-cards-container"><!----> <!----> <!----> <!----> <!----></div> <!----> <!----> <!----> <div data-v-b1bd13bb="" data-v-a660adc4="" class="segment-assistant-actions"><div data-v-b1bd13bb="" class="segment-assistant-actions-content"> <!----> <!----> <!----><div data-v-1005b780="" data-v-b1bd13bb="" class="icon-button" style="wi