f=""><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left"><code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">PhysicalDrive0</code></td><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left">256 GB / 238 GiB</td><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left">Micron 1100 SATA 256GB ← <strong data-v-01af594f="">Your laptop's SSD</strong></td></tr><tr data-v-01af594f=""><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left"><code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">PhysicalDrive1</code></td><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left">62 GB / 58 GiB</td><td data-v-01af594f="" align="left">VendorCo ProductCode ← <strong data-v-01af594f="">YOUR USB!</strong></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class="paragraph" dir="auto"><strong>Your USB IS there!</strong> It's <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">PhysicalDrive1 - 62 GB / 58 GiB - VendorCo ProductCode</code></div><hr><h2>Next Steps</h2><ol start="1"><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Use <strong>Arrow keys</strong> to select <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">PhysicalDrive1</code> (the USB)</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Press <strong>Enter</strong> to proceed</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">On the next screen, select <strong>Intel/PC partition</strong></div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Press <strong>Enter</strong></div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Select <strong>Analyse</strong></div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Press <strong>Enter</strong></div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Select <strong>Quick Search</strong></div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Press <strong>Enter</strong></div></li></ol><div class="paragraph" dir="auto"><strong>Select <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">PhysicalDrive1</code> now and press Enter!</strong> 🚀</div></div></div> <!----> <!----> <!----></div>  <!----> <!----> <!----> <!---->   <!----> <div data-v-38e35b58="" class="okc-cards-container"><!----> <!----> <!----> <!----> <!----></div> <!----> <!----> <!----> <div data-v-b1bd13bb="" data-v-a660adc4="" class="segment-assistant-actions"><div data-v-b1bd13bb="" class="segment-assistant-actions-content"> <!----> <!----> <!----><div data-v-1005b780="" data-v-b1bd13bb="" class="icon-button" style="width: 28px; height: 28px;"><svg data-v-1005b780="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" role="img" class="iconify" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" name="Copy"><path d="M725.333333 302.933333a166.4 166.4 0 0 1 166.4 166.4v256a166.4 166.4 0 0 1-166.4 166.4h-256A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 302.933333 725.333333v-256A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 469.333333 302.933333h256z m-256 76.8A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 379.733333 469.333333v256c0 49.493333 40.106667 89.6 89.6 89.6h256a89.6 89.6 0 0 0 89.6-89.6v-256A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 725.333333 379.733333h-256z" fill="currentColor"></path><path d="M554.666667 132.266667a166.4 166.4 0 0 1 144.128 83.2 38.4 38.4 0 0 1-66.517334 38.4A89.514667 89.514667 0 0 0 554.666667 209.066667H298.666667A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 209.066667 298.666667v256c0 33.109333 17.92 62.08 44.8 77.653333a38.4 38.4 0 0 1-38.4 66.474667A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 132.266667 554.666667V298.666667A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 298.666667 132.266667h256z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg> <!----></div><!----> <!----><div data-v-1005b780="" data-v-b1bd13bb="" class="icon-button" style="width: 28px; height: 28px;"><svg data-v-1005b780="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" role="img" class="iconify" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" name="Refresh"><path d="M303.104 315.392c114.688-114.688 303.104-114.688 417.792 0l-32.768 32.768c-20.48 20.48-4.096 57.344 24.576 57.344h118.784c16.384 0 32.768-16.384 32.768-32.768V253.952c0-28.672-36.864-45.056-57.344-24.576l-32.768 32.768c-143.36-143.36-376.832-143.36-520.192 0s-143.36 376.832 0 520.192 376.832 143.36 520.192 0c49.152-49.152 77.824