class="markdown"><div data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code"><div data-v-13fde6a9="" data-v-8d822fd1="" class="sticky-release" style="--sticky-header-height: 42.5px;"><div data-v-13fde6a9="" class="sticky-release-rail"><div data-v-13fde6a9="" class="sticky-release-header" style="top: 0px;"><header data-v-8d822fd1="" class="segment-code-header"><div data-v-8d822fd1="" class="segment-code-header-content"><span data-v-8d822fd1="" class="segment-code-lang">plain</span> <!----> <span data-v-868ea423="" data-v-8d822fd1=""><div data-v-1005b780="" data-v-868ea423="" class="icon-button" style="width: 32px; height: 32px;"><svg data-v-1005b780="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" role="img" class="iconify" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" name="Copy"><path d="M725.333333 302.933333a166.4 166.4 0 0 1 166.4 166.4v256a166.4 166.4 0 0 1-166.4 166.4h-256A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 302.933333 725.333333v-256A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 469.333333 302.933333h256z m-256 76.8A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 379.733333 469.333333v256c0 49.493333 40.106667 89.6 89.6 89.6h256a89.6 89.6 0 0 0 89.6-89.6v-256A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 725.333333 379.733333h-256z" fill="currentColor"></path><path d="M554.666667 132.266667a166.4 166.4 0 0 1 144.128 83.2 38.4 38.4 0 0 1-66.517334 38.4A89.514667 89.514667 0 0 0 554.666667 209.066667H298.666667A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 209.066667 298.666667v256c0 33.109333 17.92 62.08 44.8 77.653333a38.4 38.4 0 0 1-38.4 66.474667A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 132.266667 554.666667V298.666667A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 298.666667 132.266667h256z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg> <div data-v-5f9e9bf6="" data-v-1005b780="" class="kimi-tooltip tooltip-bottom icon-button-tooltip bottom">Copy</div></div></span></div></header></div></div></div> <div data-v-efb858b9="" data-v-8d822fd1="" class="syntax-highlighter dark segment-code-content"><pre data-v-efb858b9="" class="language-plain"><code class="language-plain">The USB shows in Disk Management as two parts:</code></pre></div></div> <div data-v-d664c8c3=""></div><ul start="1"><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto"><strong>1 MB</strong> — Healthy (small partition)</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto"><strong>58.59 GB</strong> — <strong>Unallocated</strong> (the rest is empty)</div></li></ul><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">The <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">ISO1 (I:)</code> is only 7.81GB — that's the SystemRescue ISO partition. The rest (58.59GB) is unallocated and not visible in Explorer.</div><hr><h2>Fix: Create a New Partition on the USB</h2><ol start="1"><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">In <strong>Disk Management</strong>, right-click the <strong>58.59 GB Unallocated</strong> space on Disk 1</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Click <strong>New Simple Volume</strong></div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Click <strong>Next</strong></div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Enter size: <strong>59900</strong> (or just click Next to use all)</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Assign drive letter: <strong>E:</strong> (or any available)</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Format as <strong>exFAT</strong> → click <strong>Next</strong> → <strong>Finish</strong></div></li></ol><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Now your USB will show as a normal drive in Explorer with ~58GB!</div><hr><h2>Or: Delete the ISO1 Partition First</h2><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">If you want to merge everything:</div><ol start="1"><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Right-click <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">ISO1 (I:)</code> → <strong>Delete Volume</strong></div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Right-click the now-unallocated space → <strong>New Simple Volume</strong></div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Use all space, format as <strong>exFAT</strong></div></li></ol><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">This gives you one clean 58GB USB drive.</div><hr><div class="paragraph" dir="auto"><strong>Right-click the 58.59 GB Unallocated on Disk 1 → New Simple Volume → Next → Next → exFAT → Finish</strong></div><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Tell me when it's done! 🚀</div></div></div> <!----> <!----> <!----></div>  <!----> <!----> <!----> <!---->   <!----> <div data-v-38e35b58="" class="okc-cards-container"><!----> <!----> <!----> <!----> <!----></div> <!----> <!----> <!----> <div data-v-b1bd13bb="" data-v-a660adc4="" class="segment-assistant-actions"><div data-v-b1bd13bb="" class="segment-assistant-actions-content"> <!----> <!----> <!----><div data-v-1005b780="" data-v-b1bd13bb="" class="icon-button" style="width: 28px; height: 28px;"><svg data-v-1005b780="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" role="img" class="iconify" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" name="Copy"><path d="M725.333333 302.933333a166.4 166.4 0 0 1 166.4 166.4v256a166.4 166.4 0 0 1-166.4 166.4h-256A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 302.933333 725.333333v-256A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 469.333333 302.933333h256z m-256 76.8A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 379.733333 469.333333v256c0 49.493333 40.106667 89.6 89.6 89.6h256a89.6 89.6 0 0 0 89.6-89.6v-256A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 725.333333 379.733333h-256z" fill="currentColor"></path><path d="M554.666667 132.266667a166.4 166.4 0 0 1 144.128 83.2 38.4 38.4 0 0 1-66.517334 38.4A89.514667 89.514667 0 0 0 554.666667 209.066667H298.666667A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 209.066667 298.666667v256c0 33.109333 17.92 62.08 44.8 77.653333a38.4 38.4 0 0 1-38.4 66.474667A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 132.266667 554.666667V298.666667A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 298.666667 132.266667h256z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg> <!----></div><!----> <!----><div data-v-1005b780="" data-v-b1bd13bb="" class="icon-button" style="width: 28px; height: 28px;"><svg data-v-1005b780="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" role="img" class="iconify" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" name="Refresh"