h" dir="auto">Use GitHub Issues to track future cybersecurity challenges</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Add topics/tags: <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">cybersecurity</code>, <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">linux</code>, <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">grub</code>, <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">parrot-os</code>, <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">dual-boot</code></div></li></ul><div class="paragraph" dir="auto"><strong>Want me to modify anything in the README?</strong> (Add more technical details, change the tone, add a troubleshooting section, etc.) 🚀</div></div></div> <!----> <!----> <!----></div>  <!----> <!----> <!----> <!---->   <!----> <div data-v-38e35b58="" class="okc-cards-container"><!----> <!----> <!----> <!----> <!----></div> <!----> <!----> <!----> <div data-v-b1bd13bb="" data-v-a660adc4="" class="segment-assistant-actions"><div data-v-b1bd13bb="" class="segment-assistant-actions-content"> <!----> <!----> <!----><div data-v-1005b780="" data-v-b1bd13bb="" class="icon-button" style="width: 28px; height: 28px;"><svg data-v-1005b780="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" role="img" class="iconify" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" name="Copy"><path d="M725.333333 302.933333a166.4 166.4 0 0 1 166.4 166.4v256a166.4 166.4 0 0 1-166.4 166.4h-256A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 302.933333 725.333333v-256A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 469.333333 302.933333h256z m-256 76.8A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 379.733333 469.333333v256c0 49.493333 40.106667 89.6 89.6 89.6h256a89.6 89.6 0 0 0 89.6-89.6v-256A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 725.333333 379.733333h-256z" fill="currentColor"></path><path d="M554.666667 132.266667a166.4 166.4 0 0 1 144.128 83.2 38.4 38.4 0 0 1-66.517334 38.4A89.514667 89.514667 0 0 0 554.666667 209.066667H298.666667A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 20