smart.</div><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">The actual dates:</div><ul start="1"><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">GRUB recovery: July 2, 2026 (from the timestamps in the conversation)</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Partition expansion attempt: July 13, 2026 (from the image timestamps)</div></li></ul><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Let me create this README now.</div></div></div></div></div> </div></div></div><div data-v-004597db="" class="block-item"><div data-v-d664c8c3=""><div data-v-863d6f1b="" data-v-d664c8c3="" class="toolcall-container default toolcall-ipython"><div data-v-bc9c95fe="" data-v-863d6f1b="" class="toolcall-title-container default"><div data-v-bc9c95fe="" class="toolcall-title-name line"><svg data-v-bc9c95fe="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" role="img" class="iconify toolcall-title-name-icon" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" name="Code"><path d="M705.28 642.56a35.541333 35.541333 0 0 1 0 70.741333l-3.669333 0.170667H512a35.541333 35.541333 0 0 1 0-71.082667h189.610667l3.626666 0.170667zM297.216 320.938667a35.584 35.584 0 0 1 47.573333-2.432l2.730667 2.432 114.261333 114.261333a75.093333 75.093333 0 0 1 0 106.197333l-114.261333 114.261334-2.730667 2.474666a35.584 35.584 0 0 1-50.005333-50.048l2.432-2.730666 114.304-114.261334a3.968 3.968 0 0 0 0-5.589333L297.173333 371.2a35.584 35.584 0 0 1 0-50.261333z" fill="currentColor"></path><path d="M725.333333 132.266667A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 891.733333 298.666667v426.666666a166.4 166.4 0 0 1-166.4 166.4H298.666667A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 132.266667 725.333333V298.666667A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 298.666667 132.266667h426.666666zM298.666667 209.066667A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 209.066667 298.666667v426.666666c0 49.493333 40.106667 89.6 89.6 89.6h426.666666a89.6 89.6 0 0 0 89.6-89.6V298.666667A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 725.333333 209.066667H298.666667z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg> <span data-v-bc9c95fe="" class="toolcall-title-name-text">Execute Python 