ph" dir="auto"><strong>Done!</strong> The images will display inline because the README references them as <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">screenshots/01-fdisk-output.jpg</code> etc.</div></li></ol><hr><h2>What's Inside</h2><ul start="1"><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto"><strong>No emojis</strong> - just raw, human writing</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto"><strong>Simple hyphens</strong> (-) instead of fancy dashes</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto"><strong>Real emotions</strong> - frustration, relief, excitement, the "I almost shouted" moment</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto"><strong>Actual dates</strong> - July 2, 2026 for GRUB recovery, July 13, 2026 for partition expansion</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto"><strong>All 17 screenshots</strong> embedded with context</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto"><strong>Your voice</strong> - curious, smart, excited, learning by breaking things</div></li></ul><div class="paragraph" dir="auto"><strong>Want me to change anything?</strong> Add more detail, adjust the tone, include more technical deep-dives? 🚀</div></div></div> <!----> <!----> <!----></div>  <!----> <!----> <!----> <!---->   <!----> <div data-v-38e35b58="" class="okc-cards-container"><!----> <!----> <!----> <!----> <!----></div> <!----> <!----> <!----> <div data-v-b1bd13bb="" data-v-a660adc4="" class="segment-assistant-actions"><div data-v-b1bd13bb="" class="segment-assistant-actions-content"> <!----> <!----> <!----><div data-v-1005b780="" data-v-b1bd13bb="" class="icon-button" style="width: 28px; height: 28px;"><svg data-v-1005b780="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" role="img" class="iconify" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" name="Copy"><path d="M725.333333 302.933333a166.4 166.4 0 0 1 166.4 166.4v256a166.4 166.4 0 0 1-166.4 166.4h-256A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 302.933333 725.333333v-256A166.4 166.4 0 0