ntainer-block"><div data-v-004597db="" class="block-item"><div data-v-56fb9f7a="" data-v-d664c8c3="" class="toolcall-container thinking-container block-container" share-mode="false"><div data-v-bc9c95fe="" data-v-56fb9f7a="" class="toolcall-title-container default"><div data-v-bc9c95fe="" class="toolcall-title-name line"><svg data-v-bc9c95fe="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" role="img" class="iconify toolcall-title-name-icon" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" name="k15"><path d="M725.205333 166.656A320 320 0 0 0 194.773333 363.477333a317.781333 317.781333 0 0 0 99.285334 275.968 222.72 222.72 0 0 1 75.818666 162.346667v5.717333A131.328 131.328 0 0 0 501.077333 938.666667h22.016a131.328 131.328 0 0 0 131.2-131.2v-19.498667a189.269333 189.269333 0 0 1 68.693334-142.250667 319.744 319.744 0 0 0 2.218666-479.146666zM523.093333 867.584h-22.016a60.16 60.16 0 0 1-60.117333-60.074667l-0.256-11.008h142.506667v11.008a60.16 60.16 0 0 1-60.117334 60.074667z m152.917334-275.2A272.64 272.64 0 0 0 591.957333 725.333333h-44.330666v-255.445333a106.666667 106.666667 0 0 0 71.125333-100.096 35.584 35.584 0 1 0-71.125333 0 35.584 35.584 0 0 1-71.082667 0 35.584 35.584 0 1 0-71.125333 0 106.666667 106.666667 0 0 0 71.125333 100.096V725.333333h-47.018667a307.029333 307.029333 0 0 0-87.04-137.984 248.874667 248.874667 0 0 1 169.941334-430.933333 246.101333 246.101333 0 0 1 165.376 63.232 248.661333 248.661333 0 0 1-1.706667 372.693333h-0.085333z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg> <span data-v-bc9c95fe="" class="toolcall-title-name-text">Explain why GitHub README images don't appear without files</span></div> <!----> <div data-v-bc9c95fe="" class="toolcall-title-container-extra"> <svg data-v-bc9c95fe="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" role="img" class="iconify toolcall-title-container-extra-arrow" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" name="Right_b"><path d="M681.00096 549.23264a36.864 36.864 0 0 0-0.08192-52.0192L395.22304 211.47648a36.864 36.864 0 1 0-52.14208 52.10112l259.6864 259.72736-259.76832 261.69344a36.864 36.864 0 0 0 52.30592 51.93728l285.696-287.744z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div></div> <div data-v-9445e104="" data-v-56fb9f7a="" class="toolcall-content"><div data-v-9445e104="" class="resize-container" style="height: 0px; opacity: 0;"><div data-v-9445e104="" class="slot-container"><div data-v-3b9ae98b="" data-v-56fb9f7a="" class="markdown-container toolcall-content-text"><div data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="markdown"><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">The user is asking if the pictures will show up on GitHub. The README references images like <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">screenshots/01-fdisk-output.jpg</code>, but those files don't exist in the output directory - they're just references in the markdown. The user uploaded images during our conversation, but I don't have a way to package those images into a downloadable folder for them.</div><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">I need to explain:</div><ol start="1"><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">The README has markdown image references like <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">![description](screenshots/01-filename.jpg)</code></div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">For these to display on GitHub, they need to actually upload the image files to a <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">screenshots/</code> folder in their repo</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">I can only provide the README text file - they need to manually save and rename their screenshots and upload them alongside the README</div></li></ol><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">I should be clear and honest about this limitation.</div></div></div></div></div> </div></div></div></div> <!----> <!----><!----> <div data-v-3b9ae98b="" data-v-d664c8c3="" class="markdown-container"><div data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="markdown"><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">Yes, but <strong>only if you upload the actual image files</strong> alongside the README!</div><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">The README contains references like:</div><div data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code"><div data-v-13fde6a9="" data-v-8d822fd1="" class="sticky-release" style="--sticky-header-height: 42.5px;"><div data-v-13fde6a9="" class="sticky-release-rail"><div data-v-13fde6a9="" class="sticky-release-header" style="top: 0px;"><header data-v-8d822fd1="" class="segment-code-header"><div data-v-8d822fd1="" class="segment-code-header-content"><span data-v-8d822fd1="" class="segment-code-lang">markdown</span> <!----> <span data-v-868ea423="" data-v-8d822fd1=""><div data-v-1005b780="" data-v-868ea423="" class="icon-button" style="width: 32px; height: 32px;"><svg data-v-1005b780="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" role="img" class="iconify" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" name="Copy"><path d="M725.333333 302.933333a166.4 166.4 0 0 1 166.4 166.4v256a166.4 166.4 0 0 1-166.4 166.4h-256A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 302.933333 725.333333v-256A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 469.333333 302.933333h256z m-256 76.8A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 379.733333 469.333333v256c0 49.493333 40.106667 89.6 89.6 89.6h256a89.6 89.6 0 0 0 89.6-89.6v-256A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 725.333333 379.733333h-256z" fill="currentColor"></path><path d="M554.666667 132.266667a166.4 166.4 0 0 1 144.128 83.2 38.4 38.4 0 0 1-66.517334 38.4A89.514667 89.514667 0 0 0 554.666667 209.066667H298.666667A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 209.066667 298.666667v256c0 33.109333 17.92 62.08 44.8 77.653333a38.4 38.4 0 0 1-38.4 66.474667A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 132.266667 554.666667V298.666667A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 298.666667 132.266667h256z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg> <div data-v-5f9e9bf6="" data-v-1005b780="" class="kimi-tooltip tooltip-bottom icon-button-tooltip bottom">Copy</div></div></span></div></header></div></div></div> <div data-v-efb858b9="" data-v-8d822fd1="" class="syntax-highlighter dark segment-code-content"><pre data-v-efb858b9="" class="language-markdown"><code class="language-markdown"><span class="token url"><span class="token operator">!</span>[<span class="token content">fdisk output</span>](<span class="token url">screenshots/01-fdisk-output.jpg</span>)</span></code></pre></div></div> <div data-v-d664c8c3=""></div><div class="paragraph" dir="auto">For GitHub to display the images, you need to:</div><ol start="1"><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto"><strong>Create a <code data-v-8d822fd1="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="segment-code-inline">screenshots/</code> folder</strong> in your GitHub repo</div></li><li><div class="paragraph" dir="auto"><strong>Upload your actual image files</strong> into that folder with the matching names</div></li></ol><hr><h2>What You Need to Do</h2><div data-v-01af594f="" data-v-3b9ae98b="" class="table markdown-table"><div data-v-13fde6a9="" data-v-01af594f="" class="sticky-release" style="--sticky-header-height: 42.5px;"><div data-v-13fde6a9="" class="sticky-release-rail"><div data-v-13fde6a9="" class="sticky-release-header" style="top: 0px;"><header data-v-01af594f="" class="table-actions"><div data-v-01af594f="" class="table-actions-content"><span data-v-01af594f="" class="table-title">Table</span> <span data-v-868ea423="" data-v-01af594f=""><div data-v-1005b780="" data-v-868ea423="" class="icon-button" style="width: 32px; height: 32px;"><svg data-v-1005b780="" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" role="img" class="iconify" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 1024 1024" name="Copy"><path d="M725.333333 302.933333a166.4 166.4 0 0 1 166.4 166.4v256a166.4 166.4 0 0 1-166.4 166.4h-256A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 302.933333 725.333333v-256A166.4 166.4 0 0 1 469.333333 302.933333h256z m-256 76.8A89.6 89.6 0 0 0 379.733333 469.333333v256c0 49.493333 40.106667 89.6 89.6 89.6h256a89.6 89.6 0 0 0 89.6-89.6v-256A89.